    <node id="European Union">
      <data key="d0">European Union</data>
      <data key="d1">geo</data>
      <data key="d2">The European Union (EU) is a significant political and economic union comprised of 27 member countries predominantly situated in Europe. Established to promote integration and cooperation among its members, the EU develops and implements extensive common policies and legal frameworks across various domains, which include finance, technology, consumer protection, cybersecurity, migration, and governance. Central to the EU's mission are the shared values of fundamental rights and freedoms, which are enshrined in its Treaties.

To ensure consistency and facilitate cooperation among member states, the EU enacts numerous regulations and directives that govern a multitude of issues. Key areas addressed by these regulations encompass data protection, financial services, product liability, and the oversight of artificial intelligence (AI) systems. The EU holds the authority to impose fines for non-compliance with its regulations, reinforcing its role in enforcing laws and maintaining high standards across the union.

The European Commission operates as the executive body of the EU, responsible for the development and implementation of the union's regulations and policies. This regulatory framework plays a crucial role in shaping governance and influences daily life within member states, particularly concerning law enforcement and judicial cooperation. Additionally, the EU fosters international collaboration and unified policymaking among its member countries, especially in critical areas such as migration and asylum policies, and establishes foundational guidelines for the regulation of high-risk AI systems, including those pertaining to biometric data processing and market surveillance. 

Overall, the European Union is dedicated to creating and maintaining a cohesive legislative structure that addresses contemporary challenges, ensuring cooperation, and promoting shared standards among its diverse member states.&lt;SEP&gt;The European Union is a political and economic union of member states in Europe, responsible for establishing regulations and standards, including those related to AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;The European Union is a political and economic union of member states located in Europe that aims to promote integration and collaboration among its members.&lt;SEP&gt;The European Union is a political and economic union of member states located primarily in Europe, governing regulatory standards and policies.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f13d730755b7535c59eb130d6f7ac62e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-620a69f3197e8df8e7c863ebf2c2155c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b0054dbaea0e7f90c303fe7d7a824d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0073df6368131f4f385a66430ef1c4f4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-74def3a33d9c60f3c11227adf7704a09&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c168b1207668ad4ba646371f91bfce09&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b16c22014fb75795531a9a187b8fc81&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6e853663a3f2d06a9cfea8582e10f089&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-111c71f234a0f2d1b26490907acae6eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c2f867de2be6cb439557f91700b051c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc038db2f25d511bf84cccc9550e10c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ec0d2d3cbe2a53a3bbf6373c775edf2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cde8f1eff9bf42001a30603a860556d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2af15b193dbeb2497919d2971657871e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-256a6003a5841f2764536c55f7086431&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-010f171cc1a7f217689efe00fd8cb656&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0271020749ae70ce56cbd607a6f6662a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f77911358a1d821f6b1731fac6d2dbd6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9bece07e296fce9647a40a0dde904fe4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa9e2916955e882c73231ed69851f6ec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e78bce1eaa5df9c186492b5e1482218&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9db4c15b43d1b7a1a1138d5a7403b240&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e93fbd1f7fc7cbb860b708f989987b57&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bbb30099cdacdc2f1eb2ed182c6b4491&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3177468233ec37ad2a71dc38caa17377&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a90a47461f525bba18d74c42ea04f88&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-85605aee8aaac2bf4ad29d80d902148f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de6a0d59bb86cca6093fbb52cf156b4e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc0db03f57b007cfc458657e88e273ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ec3aceb64afa671f57d404e61126379b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ae8bdbb57af24d78fe2313201571bea7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a84d660603389dd91dcd96134d5bb46e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc662d7e26079b23ad5010b8671bfb7d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-475967c83e624bc711a9ff13e8150163&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-119d91aacb77775b61f5eddaf23771be&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-99c78ffcf815fa82f05dcb7dc5871e1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4882abf1dd869d3dff00b8d88ee946a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c8a6b92fbe8d93eb878957c5ed60aa0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2739984aae71aa27a0af867bc197b730&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8022b105f5e7e2d0ba74bbe75f31f87</data>
