    <node id="Charter of Fundamental Rights">
      <data key="d0">Charter of Fundamental Rights</data>
      <data key="d1">document</data>
      <data key="d2">The Charter of Fundamental Rights is a key document that outlines fundamental rights and freedoms adopted by the European Union, guiding the development of technologies like AI.&lt;SEP&gt;The Charter of Fundamental Rights outlines the fundamental rights protected within the European Union, applicable to individuals in contexts involving law enforcement and AI systems.</data>
