    <node id="Fundamental Rights">
      <data key="d0">Fundamental Rights</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Fundamental Rights are basic legal rights that belong to individuals, which must be supervised and upheld within organizational practices and regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Fundamental Rights are the essential human rights recognized and protected by law, serving as crucial legal freedoms that must be respected and safeguarded for every individual. They encompass key aspects such as equality, dignity, privacy, freedom of expression, and protection from harm. In the context of high-risk artificial intelligence (AI) systems, the preservation of these rights is vital to maintain democracy and uphold the rule of law amidst the potential challenges posed by AI technologies in public use.

In the framework of the European Union, Fundamental Rights form the legal foundation for guiding regulatory efforts, ensuring that AI operates within a structure that prioritizes human dignity and individual freedoms. The deployment of high-risk AI systems can present significant challenges that may compromise these rights, which underscores the necessity of implementing regulatory measures aimed at protecting them. Therefore, Fundamental Rights play a pivotal role not only in the development and deployment of AI technologies but also in ensuring that basic human rights and freedoms are maintained throughout the entire process. Service providers are expected to observe these rights while managing AI-related risks, reinforcing their importance in the realm of technology and governance.&lt;SEP&gt;Fundamental rights encompass the basic freedoms and rights to which all individuals are entitled, which may be affected by intrusive technologies like AI.&lt;SEP&gt;Fundamental rights are basic human rights that are guaranteed to all individuals, including the right to privacy and security.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9685a1f72e235a3f5b9ee69878eedb21&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fe49d95d50900e82a706b2766339562f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fe76292b9a553c383dab6b0a4a67cee8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7859a0c655f74761757b416c3b50bf36&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6e853663a3f2d06a9cfea8582e10f089&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9cac929d0048fe34377179e8ecde4a5c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7114fa80a4a18326b68b2fd61f65c047&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cde8f1eff9bf42001a30603a860556d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58a25c0dd884625561b248cf275f154e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e284955c1d36330bd14d117bb417611&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b5e606b14946a1b388f008868e8e155&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e78bce1eaa5df9c186492b5e1482218&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2440fb0070f3198e96bd1ad753ae3e0a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-37d88f95110db00bbf8230a2632a2035&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a46d97529092ce970fc3194f0ff15f99&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21acb22d994b8f65ea3709a99eb85032&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2315cd7abb88dee440f081de5430a32f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de3f18a6d766d2baa57ae891b9da7741&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-739e3d9c7841d79a7701d630f8c7fa26&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab148daacc5693b15ec462635a5502a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50beca99a2207706ee9f0ad17a4205ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-95424b9dff57302628c496570b4baff4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5928be36056ac91865bd3e4d596159e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8f21b63428a38759e45ffcb10bac3d8</data>
