    <node id="Union Harmonisation Legislation">
      <data key="d0">Union Harmonisation Legislation</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">These laws regulate products across the Union to ensure they meet safety and efficacy standards prior to market entry.&lt;SEP&gt;Union Harmonisation Legislation encompasses a comprehensive set of legal frameworks established by the European Union (EU) aimed at ensuring uniformity and standardization across its member states. This legislation is particularly relevant to high-risk artificial intelligence (AI) systems, aiming to ensure that such systems adhere to established safety and operational standards. By standardizing rules and procedures, Union Harmonisation Legislation facilitates consistency in laws across various sectors, including AI and medical devices.

The legislation plays a crucial role in promoting market safety, protecting consumers, and ensuring conformity assessment of products before they enter the market. It includes multiple EU regulations and directives that collectively work to uphold high-quality requirements for all products, thereby contributing to a harmonized regulatory environment within the EU. Additionally, it addresses aspects of market surveillance and compliance, aiming to ensure that all products meet established safety and compliance standards. Overall, Union Harmonisation Legislation is essential for fostering a safe and compliant marketplace across the European Union.&lt;SEP&gt;Union harmonisation legislation is a regulatory framework that dictates compliance standards for products, ensuring safety where high-risk AI systems are involved.&lt;SEP&gt;Union harmonisation legislation aims to ensure the free movement of products within the internal market while ensuring safety and compliance of those products.&lt;SEP&gt;Union Harmonisation Legislation refers to the legal framework established by the European Union to ensure that products meet specific safety, health, and environmental standards across member states.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ff61ec794793cf787d4a0473487a06f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f12c01099dadb1fc1008ce18c7d800e8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-13991bdab077b3114e8913f89a1371e5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c168b1207668ad4ba646371f91bfce09&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6bf82c08e44c3a6e12c9472e052df840&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b4348ad8873ef2041aca94abc9297ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-00e7606a0fa9d588f18d67d02cfcf654&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-18cf1aa30864348514b20fe64038fba8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f56b40e98f8949a37c3ab283b01f7050&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c3ee1fc3ca38d0fe1cd19861a325e159&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c0711090702fd9b1787822998d5deac9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a8bd64d122f5a09e9e3859bf77c6931&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70555b8168fcbd401cc11093ec15091a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5ab1f3b6cbb052c58ff3b9fc75a6d7a2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff611ee371ea780574e9c16859c31f2f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04f1483cdf6b84729e33ebc4a611375b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-17ccf2ddbeca1f4e8b771a2316b7d16c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa2298fd83910d35175065de74977bd4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-13bd6c41d609ae7976a7b3ac4ab8e3fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53fb2685a38836a165fa7637bbbadce2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ad9c740a10a5c1577e578a593bd61fd</data>
