    <node id="AI System">
      <data key="d0">AI System</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">An AI system is a software product that can be classified as high-risk or not under specific regulations, affecting its safety assessment.&lt;SEP&gt;The AI System refers to a range of artificial intelligence technologies and solutions developed and deployed by organizations, particularly those subject to regulations from Union institutions. These advanced technologies are designed to perform tasks that typically require human intelligence, such as learning, decision-making, and data processing. AI systems can operate autonomously or with varying degrees of autonomy, allowing them to make predictions, generate content, and influence their environments based on input data. 

Characterized by sophisticated algorithms that simulate human intelligence, AI systems are marketable technological products required to comply with strict regulatory standards, especially concerning their deployment and testing. This regulatory framework is especially critical for high-risk AI systems, which undergo stringent conformity assessments due to potential risks to health, safety, and fundamental rights. Such systems may function independently or as components of other products, complicating the regulatory landscape and safety assessments.

To ensure adherence to data protection standards, AI systems are developed, tested, and validated within specific regulatory frameworks, often referred to as regulatory sandboxes. The categorization of these systems is essential as it underscores their impact on individuals and society, prompting significant concerns regarding rights, health, and safety. 

AI systems have diverse applications across multiple sectors, including civilian domains, law enforcement, and military environments. They are capable of identifying individuals through biometric data comparison, sometimes without the individuals' active participation, by capturing data from a distance. Ensuring continuous oversight, comprehensive risk management strategies, and regular software updates is vital for the effective functioning of high-risk AI systems. Oversight is typically managed by designated authorities, such as the AI Office, which ensures regulatory compliance throughout the lifecycle of these technologies. Consequently, AI systems represent a crucial intersection of technological innovation and regulatory accountability.&lt;SEP&gt;An AI system refers to any artificial intelligence technology subject to regulation, which may be classified as high-risk based on its evaluation.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a64bfb94635a0df2f808b2f8a494bd3e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a94885e0b736d24263914e9a9d565900&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7d18c3755735a13a436e766a5ca73fc4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb0291da832d9defa94aaf2262ad3761&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ac98f64f8751ad51246ca16d843f030&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7d62750f1113d24ac155fcd2b2ef02c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b4348ad8873ef2041aca94abc9297ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be61089eed18cfaf2703713378c589a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2edb4e37d5b6a1ec68d071ea273b4e52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ef570a9dfbda3c55d0d5bcc36fd77c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-071372b252509d0e29e64264c0511359&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e284955c1d36330bd14d117bb417611&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ffa7662f1a996e8ed97ec3caf0ae564&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b5e606b14946a1b388f008868e8e155&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c3ee1fc3ca38d0fe1cd19861a325e159&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28daf57045ce50f0bd160cddd41ffc14&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b28a4b325cc05a6cc4897f58ccdf00f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4acea71d2f59038573b7ec13db4ad10b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c237e1a0b42db9afb10cc8a045dbb751&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-65f69156748df83d9fa179140a3fe2aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2440fb0070f3198e96bd1ad753ae3e0a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d64a2a65aec35f8304efaaee30e0034d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7dbd41da6ea2a77fff5beb18c8e7c896&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a350089bbf860c041d514aa2041d9455&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2612abd3c26dca69a0acec30add3ef15&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1eea61d03ab615ac5f518e77cd220c1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6570d0db42cf764ebb073d69da0137e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc0db03f57b007cfc458657e88e273ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f5fc2b531499a81e154196ee1e86ac6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c9405f93ec3e0ccf6209ed15ef0263f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50beca99a2207706ee9f0ad17a4205ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8efd21db4fc63a879493cbb376ae904&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-475967c83e624bc711a9ff13e8150163&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-800752b66b6fe0cd70bb0290efc2fbbe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2ba08954f9ed754c2566e3c59b63ee7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-07b79b1855840c81b5d9079a82c7e9fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba5a4fee300868ea16940c9ea15f534a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4672fd3df7077626af67d20e46d3fcb4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-75ffbd2452fab424919d626f5688692d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f4ac0ccf9bd954306cee6efbfd342416</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_13.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_48.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_128.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_103.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_23.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_69.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_86.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_63.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_57.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_65.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_75.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_61.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_80.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_35.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_133.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_122.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_82.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_59.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_134.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_7.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_51.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_13.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_60.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_53.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_6.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_3.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_48.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_24.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_79.json</data>
