    <node id="EU Declaration of Conformity">
      <data key="d0">EU Declaration of Conformity</data>
      <data key="d1">document</data>
      <data key="d2">The EU Declaration of Conformity is a document that certifies that a product meets the safety and environmental standards set by the European Union.&lt;SEP&gt;The EU Declaration of Conformity is a formal statement that certifies a high-risk AI system as compliant with the relevant legislation and requirements of the European Union.&lt;SEP&gt;The EU Declaration of Conformity is an essential document that confirms a product's compliance with all applicable European Union regulations and standards. It serves as a formal statement indicating that a product, including high-risk AI systems, adheres to the essential requirements established by EU regulations. This documentation is critical for market access, affirming that the product meets the necessary safety and regulatory standards required to be marketed within the EU. In summary, the EU Declaration of Conformity is a vital component for compliance assurance, particularly for high-risk AI systems, ensuring they fulfill all relevant EU regulations before they can be sold in the market.&lt;SEP&gt;The EU declaration of conformity is a document that indicates a high-risk AI system's compliance with European regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;The EU Declaration of Conformity is a document that declares compliance of a product with EU standards, and is required for high-risk AI systems as part of regulatory processes.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f13d730755b7535c59eb130d6f7ac62e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9fc356102e8bbeed5152b8bb0cda2ff6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-73fd7e801c2d8d41361f6b16b45c6ed0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b7fd511ed97ef1a87c9783c3425b7d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f77911358a1d821f6b1731fac6d2dbd6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ddb5ca2a2f12bb39286916d398b70ed9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46418d497e0c090818a97380d173293d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6370e960da03a6bbdee69f64993cdae6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68d6983d829937a84d37118dacc3e39c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fdd0ab3aadbdd5226fa3661ea9057181</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_22.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_47.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_23.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_24.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_77.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_16.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_18.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_173.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_83.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1747657856</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Technical Documentation">
      <data key="d0">Technical Documentation</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Technical Documentation includes detailed information that must be provided during the conformity assessment of high-risk AI systems, detailing system modifications and performance metrics.&lt;SEP&gt;Technical Documentation represents a comprehensive collection of essential documents that offer critical information regarding the design, functionality, and compliance of products, particularly within the realm of AI systems. This documentation serves as a vital resource that includes detailed records necessary for the development and deployment of AI technologies, thereby ensuring transparency and accountability in their use. It acts as evidence of compliance with applicable regulations, which is crucial for assessing adherence to legal standards, monitoring operations, and informing stakeholders about the capabilities, limitations, and risk management associated with AI models.

Furthermore, Technical Documentation encompasses written accounts, summaries, and reports related to the design, objectives, and testing results of AI systems, including guidelines for evaluations carried out in regulatory sandboxes. It incorporates all records associated with the process, rationale, and outcomes of training and testing an AI system, reinforcing the principles of transparency and compliance. It also contains detailed specifications, operational procedures, and maintenance information pertaining to high-risk AI systems, which providers are required to maintain. Overall, Technical Documentation is indispensable for demonstrating adherence to regulatory standards and facilitating a thorough understanding of the functionalities and operational requirements of AI systems.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9685a1f72e235a3f5b9ee69878eedb21&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-873c3732f26f3ace86c77cfec67991ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f5fc2b531499a81e154196ee1e86ac6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41e5d20a8e9427a4698b84f758676994&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-55bfb9287798720e37fcd8bae961e88b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11bdaa862215570a86eed137e3092ea6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f77911358a1d821f6b1731fac6d2dbd6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ddb5ca2a2f12bb39286916d398b70ed9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46418d497e0c090818a97380d173293d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-800752b66b6fe0cd70bb0290efc2fbbe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2612abd3c26dca69a0acec30add3ef15&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b754e2170dea6f93253ec4fd1fa88d5</data>
