    <node id="AI Systems">
      <data key="d0">AI Systems</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">AI Systems are advanced technological frameworks that utilize artificial intelligence to perform tasks traditionally requiring human intelligence, such as learning, reasoning, and problem-solving. These systems play a pivotal role in a variety of critical sectors, including healthcare, finance, criminal justice, military, and law enforcement. They are categorized into high-risk and non-high-risk classifications based on their potential impact on individuals and society, particularly focusing on compliance requirements related to their operational contexts.

High-risk AI Systems, especially those integral to safety components in products like medical devices, are governed by strict regulatory frameworks. These systems are mandated to provide comprehensive compliance documentation, undergo continuous assessments by notified authorities, and participate in ongoing market surveillance to ensure their secure and effective operation throughout their lifecycle. Their functionalities involve advanced algorithms and extensive datasets that enhance decision-making through practices such as machine learning, data processing, and automation.

AI Systems also process and analyze biometric data, enabling functionalities like remote biometric identification, which raise significant concerns regarding reliability, discrimination, and ethical implications. The potential biases inherent in training data necessitate urgent ethical regulations to safeguard public welfare while promoting technological progress. Moreover, the broad applications of AI include profiling, language processing, image recognition, and the generation of synthetic content, which prompts discussions about authenticity and the risks of misinformation. The integration of emotion recognition in user interfaces introduces further ethical challenges that complicate their deployment.

Furthermore, AI Systems substantially affect employment processes, influencing recruitment, management, and employee evaluations. Given their implications for career opportunities and worker rights, many AI Systems are categorized as high-risk and are subject to strict privacy regulations, data governance standards, and ethical guidelines. 

In summary, AI Systems encompass a diverse array of technologies essential for executing tasks akin to human intelligence. Their critical role across various economic sectors highlights the importance of rigorous regulatory compliance to ensure safety, efficacy, and ethical operations, especially concerning their content-generation capabilities and interactions with individuals. The necessity for effective governance is further emphasized by these systems' vulnerability to cyberattacks, thereby underscoring the need for robust security measures in their deployment and operation within society.&lt;SEP&gt;AI systems refer to computer systems capable of performing tasks that typically require human intelligence, with implications for health and safety in various contexts.&lt;SEP&gt;AI systems encompass various technologies and applications that utilize artificial intelligence to perform tasks, including providing intermediary services.&lt;SEP&gt;AI systems in education are technological implementations aimed at enhancing digital education and training, but they are classified as high-risk when influencing access and evaluation processes.&lt;SEP&gt;AI Systems are advanced technologies that have the potential to interact with human rights, safety, and health, especially when classified as high-risk under the EU regulations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-737358b61293029e1a6d7326160654fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b31c82fb046f107cbfab945a92431bbc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3bb5eb0651d16c25633339b4b2cb2e46&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c168b1207668ad4ba646371f91bfce09&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b0c31436f0e7ce27ce5952aa2bf9ae5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2c1d05b847c03fe702172f787883fc33&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-699b82035d71a633a86a67090e5a61e8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83f37d4143e19486af167d7acee5bee6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f77911358a1d821f6b1731fac6d2dbd6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb040a8b4e6e3fa6f26776f560b6591c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb43ec5a01dc502046ab6ffbe3a25504&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b1ab686ea2085e0bf2cc7ea2cb5eb270&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e78bce1eaa5df9c186492b5e1482218&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a46d97529092ce970fc3194f0ff15f99&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c14e1756e1d8d71ac3ba07125f122da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2315cd7abb88dee440f081de5430a32f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b90abf0636c26d546e9b6724e3224ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab148daacc5693b15ec462635a5502a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ef0a2a22402771842f4d35bbf4be08d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5fb48082255c480535475ddb098366a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7963b30391bfa3d5e28ecd9a95b61010&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7e1bc352c7c8d3a7ba58b9b1a4f9f37&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77093970e26d1be04734ed16ea88f777&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2806e288e0b71013209c4ad85ecaa38b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a0ae2ebdd7c0c6e56069b878ca85c78&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fe49d95d50900e82a706b2766339562f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bbcf833252ce65fd6a1d8bd1f5a6efc1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40e75ee11aa912f1497b2a91ae655e7b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b8c1122e1044e4445aa96d7fa6d5b6e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70337c5367702b9a8ef4dd8a241aa46d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9cac929d0048fe34377179e8ecde4a5c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2bccefc944ad0794c75bc69b977c88a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-18cf1aa30864348514b20fe64038fba8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28efea7f8fe5945cce5b7be57e88efe7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28717558f1bb8bd2fd8b9542f8e2a99c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d1b92a727425c41637e16da3cb9ac9c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-602b68fe088482c0037845fc0b520c30&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-445327adc051facf545b6358f6f01466&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-431ae031d4ead528e84df75526b0f1dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-878d589bc7b69ae2d9c3a44284a1badc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-33366c5df404f