      <data key="d5">1747657747</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Health">
      <data key="d0">Health</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">A fundamental human right that AI systems must not compromise; the risk-management system seeks to protect this right throughout the AI system's lifecycle.&lt;SEP&gt;Health is a fundamental rights domain that focuses on ensuring the well-being of individuals affected by AI technologies.&lt;SEP&gt;Health refers to the condition of the body and mind, which the Regulation aims to protect against harmful AI impacts.&lt;SEP&gt;Health is a key topic addressed in the Regulation, focusing on the protection of individuals as mandated by the established rules.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7b5e606b14946a1b388f008868e8e155&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-739e3d9c7841d79a7701d630f8c7fa26&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5928be36056ac91865bd3e4d596159e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9685a1f72e235a3f5b9ee69878eedb21</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_1.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_66.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_65.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_6.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1747464807</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Safety">
      <data key="d0">Safety</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">A critical consideration in the deployment of AI systems, ensuring that such systems do not cause harm to users or the environment.&lt;SEP&gt;Safety is another critical aspect of the Regulation, ensuring that all provisions maintain a strong level of protection for individuals.&lt;SEP&gt;Safety pertains to the state of being safe from harmful effects, which the Regulation emphasizes in AI system usage.&lt;SEP&gt;Safety refers to the protective measures put in place to prevent harm from high-risk AI systems to individuals and society.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7b5e606b14946a1b388f008868e8e155&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-739e3d9c7841d79a7701d630f8c7fa26&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5928be36056ac91865bd3e4d596159e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9685a1f72e235a3f5b9ee69878eedb21</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_1.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_66.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_65.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_6.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1747464807</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Democracy">
      <data key="d0">Democracy</data>
      <data key="d1">geo</data>
      <data key="d2">Democracy is a system of government in which power is vested in the people, who rule either directly or through freely elected representatives.&lt;SEP&gt;Democracy refers to a system of government by the whole population, which the Regulation aims to uphold against AI's potential threats.&lt;SEP&gt;Democracy represents the governance system upheld by the Union, ensuring political rights and participation of its citizens.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c5928be36056ac91865bd3e4d596159e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41cdee30f8345bc3690d876d77e6845c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-543cc911c9d837b54a06d5f6ca958b34</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_2.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_61.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_1.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1747657627</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Rule of Law">
      <data key="d0">Rule of Law</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Rule of Law is the principle that all people are subject to the law, which the Regulation aims to maintain in the AI landscape.&lt;SEP&gt;The Rule of Law refers to the principle that the law applies equally to all individuals and entities, ensuring justice and accountability within the Union.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-41cdee30f8345bc3690d876d77e6845c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5928be36056ac91865bd3e4d596159e</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_2.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_1.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Environmental Protection">
      <data key="d0">Environmental Protection</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Environmental Protection encompasses efforts to safeguard the environment, which is considered in the Regulation regarding AI impacts.&lt;SEP&gt;Environmental Protection involves efforts to safeguard the environment, biodiversity, and mitigate climate change, which can be supported by AI innovations.&lt;SEP&gt;Environmental Protection encompasses regulations and initiatives by the Union aimed at conserving natural resources and promoting sustainability.&lt;SEP&gt;Environmental Protection involves policies and practices aimed at safeguarding the environment, which can be supported by innovative AI technologies.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c5928be36056ac91865bd3e4d596159e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-699b82035d71a633a86a67090e5a61e8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-878d589bc7b69ae2d9c3a44284a1badc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41cdee30f8345bc3690d876d77e6845c</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_2.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_59.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_130.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_1.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1747657660</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Startups">
      <data key="d0">Startups</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Startups are newly established businesses that are often technology-driven and are supported by the Union’s regulations to foster innovation.&lt;SEP&gt;Startups are newly established companies that the Regulation aims to assist in fostering innovation in AI technology.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f8f21b63428a38759e45ffcb10bac3d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5928be36056ac91865bd3e4d596159e</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_1.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_8.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Provider">
      <data key="d0">Provider</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">A Provider is a legal entity, which can be either a natural person or a legal organization, that plays a crucial role in the development, marketing, and deployment of artificial intelligence (AI) systems or models. These entities are primarily responsible for ensuring compliance with regulations related to the use of AI technologies, particularly within the European Union (EU) market. Providers focus on high-risk AI systems and are tasked with implementing risk-management strategies to ensure these systems are used safely and in accordance with stringent regulatory requirements.

Providers develop these high-risk AI systems, placing them on the market under their own name or trademark, thereby assuming specific obligations under EU regulations. They are required to maintain technical documentation and may be subjected to oversight by national authorities. To promote transparency and accountability, Providers must supply comprehensive documentation, which includes risk assessments related to their products.

In addition to development, Providers engage in activities such as distributing, importing, and supporting high-risk AI systems, necessitating interaction with notified bodies for conformity assessment services. They may also establish subcontracting agreements as required to ensure compliance with regulatory standards. Furthermore, Providers are responsible for the design, development, and specifications of AI systems, which requires them to clarify the intended purpose of these systems.

Providers express concerns about systemic risks associated with general-purpose AI models and are committed to managing these risks. They provide users with crucial instructions detailing potential risks and strategies for mitigation. Overall, Providers hold significant responsibilities in shaping the AI landscape by ensuring regulatory compliance, maintaining transparency, and delivering innovative AI technologies to the market. They also have the authority to notify the relevant Commission regarding the systemic risk status of the AI models they develop or offer.&lt;SEP&gt;The provider refers to any organization or entity responsible for demonstrating the compliance of high-risk AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;The Provider is the entity that supplies the AI system and is responsible for ensuring its compliance with regulatory standards.&lt;SEP&gt;The Provider refers to the entity responsible for supplying the general-purpose AI model and oversees its deployment and usage within various contexts.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a64bfb94635a0df2f808b2f8a494bd3e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b4329be6d4972c392a3a71593d402998&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e23bb4c71b510fec0bbe6570de37cd5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fe0c14a128bfd78c4c5056f7102cc152&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a21678b36bef336bf18e091bdfdb68f0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7d62750f1113d24ac155fcd2b2ef02c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be61089eed18cfaf2703713378c589a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b5e606b14946a1b388f008868e8e155&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f77911358a1d821f6b1731fac6d2dbd6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-595952fa3e7e47cb312adaaad303b73c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5406d942407c55f04629004d833f8196&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44eafa4c222bb60e722eca942751cf7d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-23ab4f338bfa06297d4c996d7d54dc70&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-18e4ea35b819263359794e3a968f44ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f55b689ece7aa049c38fdc38018dba8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-65f69156748df83d9fa179140a3fe2aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1ef1c9ca92c002cf6ad36264fe1292c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7dbd41da6ea2a77fff5beb18c8e7c896&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-43a1516ad8d48077af0d59fc01578f33&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f6e14583352886a741ac1d51eada03a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f5fc2b531499a81e154196ee1e86ac6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-69838403e8b59bb122436a0d25a9fc1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4518ca313d8493e277775e1a9267b84d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46418d497e0c090818a97380d173293d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77093970e26d1be04734ed16ea88f777&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2f186d6b95e69680f63fabb65ad924a</data>
