    <node id="Commission">
      <data key="d0">Commission</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Commission, commonly known as the European Commission, serves as a pivotal governing authority within the European Union (EU). Its primary responsibilities include proposing legislation, implementing decisions regarding standardization, and overseeing the compliance of regulations across various sectors, with a particular focus on artificial intelligence (AI) systems.

The Commission plays a critical role in establishing frameworks and support systems for enforcing regulations at the EU level. It is tasked with overseeing the classification of high-risk AI systems, managing amendments to related regulations, and ensuring that national regulations align with EU standards, especially in areas such as biometric identification systems and health technologies. The Commission emphasizes transparency and accountability in the deployment of AI, supporting market surveillance and providing guidance to regulatory authorities.

To strengthen its enforcement capabilities, the Commission has formed a scientific panel of independent experts that collects and analyzes data on AI models. This panel contributes to annual reports and regulatory inquiries regarding biometric systems. The Commission also facilitates information exchanges among EU member states, reinforcing its essential role in managing the EU's regulatory framework and ensuring compliance by both member states and national competent authorities.

Moreover, the Commission is empowered to adopt delegated acts and amend annexes related to high-risk AI systems and their conformity assessment procedures. It oversees conformity assessment bodies and manages notifications, while also being authorized to impose fines on providers of general-purpose AI models for regulatory violations. The Commission develops and updates guidelines to regulate quality management systems for microenterprises in relation to high-risk AI systems, ensuring a comprehensive approach to market surveillance across the Union.

Overall, the Commission's mission is to ensure adherence to EU laws and safety requirements, particularly concerning high-risk AI systems, by working collaboratively with member states to address compliance challenges and adopting standards that promote a responsible and compliant AI ecosystem throughout the EU.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a64bfb94635a0df2f808b2f8a494bd3e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b7fd511ed97ef1a87c9783c3425b7d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d9317b056c2a260423c79e368903cde7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fdf8a675497acfbeb420b95621b7cb31&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b0c31436f0e7ce27ce5952aa2bf9ae5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21c742eff7a2b610bb01c8c0ec233b62&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af991f85166d6ddfbbf84e4a73207d3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83f37d4143e19486af167d7acee5bee6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-97182f6b8815d40f51faf3e8eaeb7c7d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ee6d94a5f64203f09d02387acbdb39c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f116a95954c59b63ce3149e6283ed8e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-599d61ad7be34e2603c3fef13f2ff8dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ae3ab8a3b5c5d0c61e8b99fa718913b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ad25bfaa86145b8556e5d82696b8bab4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b71cdb20a8fa5befb7c30c90163cd416&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b837dd750c95d041180fa3d735328672&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-75ec68339f2da8ef06976767a0d5b494&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-55bfb9287798720e37fcd8bae961e88b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51cb0d95dff3b7f033b351a9352b26a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a0bef2c1dcc3d7b428c7611732f7ffc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2806e288e0b71013209c4ad85ecaa38b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0789803641ff590acdf82b97e7d4afbd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff61ec794793cf787d4a0473487a06f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cdf6e3e080867f88ec52fa9fabbeafd6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c49e78c25e30ed3a2557915010f14f3c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3fa5fe9ac042448be58de6c82bb33ea4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e23bb4c71b510fec0bbe6570de37cd5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b4337a268de724c492ca11805622faf1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d7f74259ac0ec20e9f3989df868f56b4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8143bb5053cad47b9eaf4c05c9556429&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-010f171cc1a7f217689efe00fd8cb656&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e215b390ecf16d1806ebe2ba8ac2c33d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e519b84a1d0987cd3b0aab32a476aa33&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f3c3fe390cb5d40b199e1bcc024928f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-447d51c65bac6d28fd62c36c3e70e08b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de6a0d59bb86cca6093fbb52cf156b4e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc8a3a685818e1a12850434d4ddcb5cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-345a8ba89ed0ea3325462384d5e16aaf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8cc9a7191827dda78eda5924876e5f7e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-97ee5867d3c03f24001b650ad752686d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c259012a2ff7