    <node id="Verification Requirement">
      <data key="d0">Verification Requirement</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">The verification requirement pertains to the need for confirmations by individuals to ensure adherence to laws or standards.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-2ed67e673a6fe0a3c79a41bb9102d44b</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_73.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Regulation (EU) 2018/858">
      <data key="d0">Regulation (EU) 2018/858</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Regulation (EU) 2018/858 addresses the approval and market surveillance of motor vehicles and their trailers, with the primary aim of enhancing safety and environmental standards within the European Union. This regulation lays down specific rules concerning the type approval of motor vehicles, ensuring that they meet rigorous safety criteria. It has also been amended by Regulation (EU) 2024/1689 to further refine these standards. Additionally, Regulation (EU) 2018/858 focuses on the integration of artificial intelligence technologies within motor vehicles, setting forth rules related to the adoption of delegated acts concerning such AI systems. Overall, this regulation is essential for maintaining high safety standards and effective market surveillance of vehicles in the EU.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e86452bf9fab5e4da73d81e6eadabb30&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9e2499910b26136c66e6e7a013d8f0b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d4ba1d5ee9be6a9378df917d6a467f31&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be3ac2351d8798fda8093d05f96f97fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c472ba24566e25512f738275d98a9e3b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2af15b193dbeb2497919d2971657871e</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_109.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_49.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_107.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1747657299</data>
    </node>
    <node id="European Parliament">
      <data key="d0">European Parliament</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The European Parliament is a central legislative institution of the European Union (EU) that represents the interests of EU citizens and plays a crucial role in the decision-making process concerning various policies and laws. As an elected body, it is composed of representatives from the EU member countries and works closely with the Council of the EU to enact regulations and adopt legislation that reflects the perspectives of its constituents.

As a principal legislative authority, the European Parliament is responsible for passing laws and regulations across multiple sectors, including financial services, consumer protection, workplace rights, transportation, aviation, and emerging technologies such as artificial intelligence (AI). Its significant legislative actions include involvement in critical regulations like Regulation (EU) 2023/988 and Regulation (EU) 2024/1689, both of which focus on cybersecurity, as well as Directive (EU) 2019/790, related to copyright and AI compliance.

Beyond its legislative functions, the European Parliament engages in discussions on vital public issues, such as data protection and whistleblower protections. It plays a key role in shaping the EU's overall governance framework, extending its responsibilities to preparing and consulting on delegated acts and regulatory frameworks. This highlights its influential position in addressing contemporary challenges within the EU.

The Parliament regularly reviews reports and assessments from the European Commission regarding the regulation and enforcement of AI systems, demonstrating its proactive approach to developing a comprehensive legislative agenda. In summary, the European Parliament is a vital decision-making and legislative body within the EU, significantly impacting the creation and approval of directives and regulations that govern various aspects of life, including asylum, migration policies, trade secrets, and standardization, thereby ensuring effective governance across multiple sectors.&lt;SEP&gt;The European Parliament is one of the main legislative bodies of the European Union, involved in the adoption of regulations and directives that govern member states.&lt;SEP&gt;The European Parliament is a key legislative body in the EU, involved in passing regulations regarding high-risk AI systems and consumer safety.&lt;SEP&gt;The European Parliament is a legislative body of the European Union that represents citizens and is involved in passing and amending legislation.&lt;SEP&gt;The European Parliament is a legislative body of the European Union, responsible for passing laws and regulations applicable to member states, including legislation on medical devices and AI systems.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-41b3ba2302e956849a6be7455071577d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3fa5fe9ac042448be58de6c82bb33ea4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b0054dbaea0e7f90c303fe7d7a824d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-711f6ce0c9e8f119b1813ffe001673da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d44e4d07784e334a8ded2c1da49b969e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-212b902a4529db42951674775ac3ec73&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b7fd511ed97ef1a87c9783c3425b7d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-74def3a33d9c60f3c11227adf7704a09&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-511a9744e58c5bca320f1c98646693c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-60a12c037b4dee54159c11f348ff3f11&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d9317b056c2a260423c79e368903cde7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c28a81721b7de3ef4442495cc499b1cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b474f9815c7033ca1ad8daff4012eff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ec0d2d3cbe2a53a3bbf6373c775edf2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cdc616126c9eed60b2893f6f0c5a24b1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e24261c10195e33e965bd7e966c33337&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2af15b193dbeb2497919d2971657871e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-762d138929f27b0266d948c0aad50daa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83f37d4143e19486af167d7acee5bee6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d7805654ce0fe0d8d9b6ba008562d2aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6485ea34e7fea16b2f5a59242c8ef2a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a23e03a78af2035b69e69bd4fc65a435&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3acb107043f5850a72cf1b047a443296&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b4fa1ad79284c6e1a9636113352a8e0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a4219a2a10d85ddd82f98b8d6267cb9b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a48f68b8943ab2f8e6bdbb9ccf3e17d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e0b46b9cdd1723562953df9638581250&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eab6e21707d57be17832ef8dfd7180a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a69b68c9998277692ac6c6341fcdcac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f182220530b59a4450fc951016283bfc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7eb5283f4e280f1ec77650d624699286&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-17045c951f494f621b2305960aade53f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a3cb5eb81289d4fb565bd824bdc63506&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bbb30099cdacdc2f1eb2ed182c6b4491&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3f7d41ecd7ed7ec26e62e63255378cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b71cdb20a8fa5befb7c30c90163cd416&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6370e960da03a6bbdee69f64993cdae6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6badc71855b10bbd17a31c7dfef0c442&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9e2499910b26136c66e6e7a013d8f0b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bedecbbbba0ded6846e6dc97756b7de5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-85605aee8aaac