      <data key="d0">Directive 2020/1828</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Directive 2020/1828 aims to improve the effectiveness of consumer protection rules at the EU level.&lt;SEP&gt;Directive 2020/1828 establishes representative actions for consumer protection and also repeals some previous directives.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6485ea34e7fea16b2f5a59242c8ef2a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c472ba24566e25512f738275d98a9e3b</data>
