      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Healthcare systems are the organization of people, institutions, and resources to deliver healthcare services to populations, affected by global health crises like the COVID-19 Pandemic.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9371d7a2e3ae86a00aab4771e39d255d</data>
