    <node id="Democratic Processes">
      <data key="d0">Democratic Processes</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Democratic Processes involve the mechanisms through which a society governs itself, including elections, civic engagement, and public discourse.&lt;SEP&gt;Democratic processes involve the methods by which a democracy operates, including elections, public discussions, and policy-making.&lt;SEP&gt;Democratic processes are the systems and methods through which individuals participate in governance and decision-making in society, emphasizing active citizenship.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7df88d0d68bb9e14cc05c3f581da8399&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7e1bc352c7c8d3a7ba58b9b1a4f9f37&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7570653f66cb58454b80be2046705a29</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_120.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_136.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_56.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1747658164</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Regulation (EU) 2019/1020">
      <data key="d0">Regulation (EU) 2019/1020</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Regulation (EU) 2019/1020 is a legal framework established to govern market surveillance activities across the EU.&lt;SEP&gt;Regulation (EU) 2019/1020 is a significant legal framework established by the European Union that governs market surveillance and the enforcement of product compliance, particularly focusing on artificial intelligence (AI) systems. Its primary aim is to enhance market surveillance and ensure that products available within the EU adhere to essential health, safety, and fundamental rights standards.

The regulation delineates comprehensive requirements and obligations for AI systems sold in the EU market, outlining essential rules to foster compliance and oversight. Key provisions include the establishment of market surveillance authorities responsible for conducting compliance evaluations and monitoring high-risk AI systems. Furthermore, it mandates reporting obligations that facilitate enhanced oversight in line with Union competition laws.

Regulation (EU) 2019/1020 also specifies procedural rights for providers of general-purpose AI models, thereby clarifying the responsibilities and powers assigned to these authorities for effective oversight. Additionally, the framework includes provisions for AI testing support structures, strengthening the regulatory regime governing product compliance and bolstering the safety of AI applications.

Overall, this regulation operates as a guiding framework for relevant authorities, such as the governing Board, and lays down crucial structures necessary for effective market surveillance and compliance across EU member states. Its overarching goal is to improve the efficiency and effectiveness of product surveillance throughout the European Union, with a pronounced emphasis on AI systems, while simultaneously addressing the safety and quality standards of all products in the European market.&lt;SEP&gt;Regulation (EU) 2019/1020 is a piece of legislation that establishes rules and guidelines for compliance and market surveillance within the European Union.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9c27775e23d04f7dd6b8ec477a62efd1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f12c01099dadb1fc1008ce18c7d800e8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-711f6ce0c9e8f119b1813ffe001673da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d4058e2567f154203a2d9dacec4bdf7c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82b1b08be1175d2e6d49ab5a294ef86a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8affbc363cca00e716c4494cb81a558a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40de45b5b0c24b78b7ef2ca4e835c29c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-610573a7c194ad780ed97782200a740c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fdf8a675497acfbeb420b95621b7cb31&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c28a81721b7de3ef4442495cc499b1cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b0c31436f0e7ce27ce5952aa2bf9ae5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b474f9815c7033ca1ad8daff4012eff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d58805118916ede230a82a4ec3f60b3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-43e82a7af456b2ae813a7217f92c2008&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a0779dfb4a5c0f82f05a67985fe0224a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9cb2802f1b508b813d06e58ae27a1f77&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28daf57045ce50f0bd160cddd41ffc14&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c0711090702fd9b1787822998d5deac9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83ca16d466deaa751e3b9dc390e91e2f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cbe4515f5aa3b0876e436a8a0dffc23e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b90abf0636c26d546e9b6724e3224ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc8a3a685818e1a12850434d4ddcb5cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e28e08bfb7b1ae3208e2c91ea6f1e4e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a5ff05678672211287e9053ebcd9c1c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc0fa7bd172fb09094c2d62c87957967&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-345a8ba89ed0ea3325462384d5e16aaf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4fcd3af92cad1d85ebf561f059acb114&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53fb2685a38836a165fa7637bbbadce2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ad9c740a10a5c1577e578a593bd61fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f4ac0ccf9bd954306cee6efbfd342416</data>
