    <node id="European Data Protection Supervisor">
      <data key="d0">European Data Protection Supervisor</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The European Data Protection Supervisor (EDPS) is an independent authority dedicated to ensuring compliance with data protection regulations within the European Union (EU). It oversees the adherence of EU institutions and bodies to data protection laws, emphasizing the protection of individual rights to privacy in their activities. The EDPS has a significant role in regulating AI-related activities, reflecting its commitment to privacy and data protection amidst a rapidly evolving digital landscape.

In addition to its oversight responsibilities, the EDPS acts as a competent market surveillance authority for Union institutions, agencies, and bodies, which broadens its regulatory scope. It possesses the authority to enforce data protection regulations and can impose fines on EU institutions that fail to comply with these laws. Through these functions, the EDPS upholds the integrity of data protection standards across the EU.

The EDPS also serves as a national competent authority concerning AI systems utilized by Union institutions, ensuring compliance with data protection law. Furthermore, it has the capability to establish AI regulatory sandboxes for Union institutions and acts in the roles of national competent authorities. The EDPS also participates as an observer in relevant board meetings, thereby reinforcing its influence and involvement in data protection governance within the EU.&lt;SEP&gt;The European Data Protection Supervisor is an authority responsible for ensuring that data protection legislation is applied and respected in the European Union.&lt;SEP&gt;The European Data Protection Supervisor is an independent authority that oversees compliance with data protection regulations within the European Union, responsible for imposing administrative fines.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c0711090702fd9b1787822998d5deac9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d42aaf56c15be020feabced14d2409d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc97d8ad7f3aa0522d885f92ee323822&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cfc036b3a79fdcd1eb36c0af6aafbb4d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b43f399350f0fc36795c0ce358459d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8da189e7622be67a80b2e12945a657cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc8a3a685818e1a12850434d4ddcb5cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e28e08bfb7b1ae3208e2c91ea6f1e4e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-72cfde8a7c3c94fdf1dc93c4253bec9e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-475967c83e624bc711a9ff13e8150163&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-472b03a027e3fcae21e86e23849e4510&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-111c71f234a0f2d1b26490907acae6eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5da2f6b1c2fa5619efa26719534e9c35&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0271020749ae70ce56cbd607a6f6662a</data>
