    <node id="Union Institutions, Agencies, and Bodies">
      <data key="d0">Union Institutions, Agencies, and Bodies</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Union institutions, agencies, and bodies are components of the European Union that may fall under the regulations set by the European Data Protection Supervisor.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c0711090702fd9b1787822998d5deac9</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_156.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Market Surveillance Authorities">
      <data key="d0">Market Surveillance Authorities</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Market Surveillance Authorities are designated regulatory entities established under European Union (EU) legislation, with a primary mandate to oversee and enforce compliance regarding high-risk AI systems. Operating within the Member States of the EU, these authorities ensure adherence to regulatory standards and assess essential documentation and data pertinent to the evaluation of AI systems. Their roles are vital in maintaining market integrity and product safety across the Union.

The authorities are tasked with enforcing safety and conformity requirements for AI systems, ensuring that these systems function safely and effectively in real-world conditions. They are empowered to report incidents, impose administrative fines for regulatory infringements, and request interventions from the European Commission to address compliance issues. This enforcement capability highlights their crucial role in protecting consumers and upholding market standards.

As governmental bodies, Market Surveillance Authorities engage in thorough oversight of the complex landscape of AI regulation. They consistently work to safeguard the market and consumers through diligent monitoring of AI deployments. Additionally, they may participate in collaborative efforts, such as sub-groups of the Board, and seek guidance from the Union AI Testing Support Structures to enhance their compliance monitoring activities.

Furthermore, Market Surveillance Authorities have the authority to request investigations regarding potential infringements relating to AI providers. Their responsibilities not only encompass ensuring compliance and safety in the testing of high-risk AI systems but also extend to monitoring products in the market across various sectors. Overall, Market Surveillance Authorities play an essential role in ensuring compliance, safety, and oversight of AI systems and related products throughout the EU.&lt;SEP&gt;Market Surveillance Authorities are responsible for monitoring the compliance of AI systems within the market and ensuring safety standards.&lt;SEP&gt;Market surveillance authorities are responsible for monitoring compliance of high-risk AI systems with regulations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f12c01099dadb1fc1008ce18c7d800e8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d4058e2567f154203a2d9dacec4bdf7c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8c5a915dca180e1c423cefa27ea6cd3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d58805118916ede230a82a4ec3f60b3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0dc307b8b7cb1f0e39aa9b4b1839c408&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53fb2685a38836a165fa7637bbbadce2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af991f85166d6ddfbbf84e4a73207d3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f77911358a1d821f6b1731fac6d2dbd6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-72498ec90c19419f10373dde7e7b51b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-98532c431ec75ae38c76dc0730337a16&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34333cde7ca701413cb4d0a0ef1129e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-878d589bc7b69ae2d9c3a44284a1badc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e978e96ac6d99cf448b53260c07dded&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c0711090702fd9b1787822998d5deac9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-18e4ea35b819263359794e3a968f44ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-599d61ad7be34e2603c3fef13f2ff8dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9fc356102e8bbeed5152b8bb0cda2ff6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d08b537f9a5bb2b4f4bbdf442ba39bdd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cbe4515f5aa3b0876e436a8a0dffc23e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-43a1516ad8d48077af0d59fc01578f33&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea1514e01d99729cb280141a24250142&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc8a3a685818e1a12850434d4ddcb5cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e28e08bfb7b1ae3208e2c91ea6f1e4e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4518ca313d8493e277775e1a9267b84d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc0fa7bd172fb09094c2d62c87957967&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-345a8ba89ed0ea3325462384d5e16aaf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2a5e7031602556ef7d57e2811f58992&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2806e288e0b71013209c4ad85ecaa38b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f4ac0ccf9bd954306cee6efbfd342416</data>
