    </node>
    <node id="Procedures">
      <data key="d0">Procedures</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Procedures are formalized steps and guidelines that notified bodies must follow to ensure impartiality, confidentiality, and integrity in their assessment activities.&lt;SEP&gt;Procedures refer to the established methods and processes that guide the functioning of the scientific panel, ensuring systematic handling of tasks.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-dbcc9707fb1611da88a5526a5558a165&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be2e0f993ca9c4e593e5fcbdd8fc03fe</data>
