    <node id="Delegated Act">
      <data key="d0">Delegated Act</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">A delegated act is a legal instrument that allows the European Commission to supplement or amend non-essential elements of a legislative act.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-762d138929f27b0266d948c0aad50daa</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_97.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Legislative Process">
      <data key="d0">Legislative Process</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">The Legislative Process in the European Union involves the procedures and steps taken by the European Parliament, the Council, and the European Commission to create and adopt laws.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-eab6e21707d57be17832ef8dfd7180a9</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_97.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Regulation (EU) 2023/988">
      <data key="d0">Regulation (EU) 2023/988</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Regulation (EU) 2023/988 is a legislative document established by the European Parliament and Council aimed at ensuring product safety for AI systems deemed not high-risk.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b3f7d41ecd7ed7ec26e62e63255378cf</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_166.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Council of the European Union">
      <data key="d0">Council of the European Union</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Council of the European Union is a fundamental decision-making body within the European Union (EU) that represents the governments of its member states. It plays a crucial role in the legislative process by working closely with the European Parliament to develop, discuss, and adopt important legislation. This institution is essential for shaping EU laws and coordinating policies on a wide range of topics, including emerging issues such as Artificial Intelligence, data governance, and data protection.

Comprising national ministers from each member state, the Council convenes to address various legislative proposals, including significant regulations such as Regulation (EU) 2023/988, which focuses on the protection of whistleblowers reporting legal infringements. The Council is instrumental in forming and enforcing laws that contribute to the governance and operational integrity of the Union. Moreover, it outlines policies that are reflective of the collective interests of the member states' governments and ensures the legislative process is informed and cohesive. Through its collaborative efforts with the European Parliament and the European Commission, the Council adopts legislation and policies that impact the lives of EU citizens.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-3fa5fe9ac042448be58de6c82bb33ea4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-74def3a33d9c60f3c11227adf7704a09&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-511a9744e58c5bca320f1c98646693c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-60a12c037b4dee54159c11f348ff3f11&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cdc616126c9eed60b2893f6f0c5a24b1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83f37d4143e19486af167d7acee5bee6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6485ea34e7fea16b2f5a59242c8ef2a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a4219a2a10d85ddd82f98b8d6267cb9b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a48f68b8943ab2f8e6bdbb9ccf3e17d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e0b46b9cdd1723562953df9638581250&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a69b68c9998277692ac6c6341fcdcac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f182220530b59a4450fc951016283bfc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7eb5283f4e280f1ec77650d624699286&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-17045c951f494f621b2305960aade53f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3f7d41ecd7ed7ec26e62e63255378cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9e2499910b26136c66e6e7a013d8f0b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6badc71855b10bbd17a31c7dfef0c442&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bedecbbbba0ded6846e6dc97756b7de5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-85605aee8aaac2bf4ad29d80d902148f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a5a3ae528d10c9d38e017d520ab6719&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-15eee417af0ebe299ed66be76a0b845a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04f1483cdf6b84729e33ebc4a611375b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41d5cbcbecdcfde489e01bbfe08dc447&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-feb00b9eef4af47cdd3264cd99d6b2e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e74c582b50b1dcae6565f7384ebbe5e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a84d660603389dd91dcd96134d5bb46e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d6fc829d58f1a7bbf3defd5cbe758b8f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be3ac2351d8798fda8093d05f96f97fa</data>
