    <node id="Directive (EU) 2020/1828">
      <data key="d0">Directive (EU) 2020/1828</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Directive (EU) 2020/1828 addresses specific measures regarding the enforcement of consumer rights in relation to unsafe products.&lt;SEP&gt;Directive (EU) 2020/1828 aims to improve protection for consumers in the context of digital services, also linked to Regulation (EU) 2023/2854.&lt;SEP&gt;Directive (EU) 2020/1828 is a legal measure aimed at protecting the collective interests of consumers in the EU.&lt;SEP&gt;Directive (EU) 2020/1828 deals with the framework for the protection of consumers in digital services, promoting transparency and accountability in online marketplaces.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f182220530b59a4450fc951016283bfc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6485ea34e7fea16b2f5a59242c8ef2a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e0b46b9cdd1723562953df9638581250&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3f7d41ecd7ed7ec26e62e63255378cf</data>
