    </node>
    <node id="Article 79">
      <data key="d0">Article 79</data>
      <data key="d1">document</data>
      <data key="d2">Article 79 is a regulation outlining procedures for addressing risks presented by high-risk AI systems within the EU.&lt;SEP&gt;Article 79 refers to regulations regarding risks associated with high-risk AI systems and the necessary actions to be taken in case of non-compliance.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-2440fb0070f3198e96bd1ad753ae3e0a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-73fd7e801c2d8d41361f6b16b45c6ed0</data>
