      <data key="d5">1747658093</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Enforcement">
      <data key="d0">Enforcement</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Enforcement is the process of ensuring that AI systems comply with established guidelines and regulations, particularly in relation to their operations in Member States.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9c76dd7edbc6dcf218d6558d18116d52</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_152.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Support Structures">
      <data key="d0">Support Structures</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Support Structures imply the frameworks and resources developed to assist Member States in the enforcement of AI systems and enhance their capabilities.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9c76dd7edbc6dcf218d6558d18116d52</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_152.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Regulation on Horizontal Cybersecurity Requirements">
      <data key="d0">Regulation on Horizontal Cybersecurity Requirements</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">This regulation outlines the cybersecurity requirements for products with digital elements, particularly in relation to high-risk AI systems.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6370e960da03a6bbdee69f64993cdae6</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_77.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="European Council">
      <data key="d0">European Council</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The European Council is a vital institution within the European Union, comprising the heads of state or government of EU member countries. It plays a crucial role in guiding EU policies and setting the overall political direction and priorities of the Union. Specifically, the council is responsible for shaping the political framework of the EU, influencing important regulations such as those related to cybersecurity and artificial intelligence, including EU regulation 2019/881. The European Council actively participates in legislative discussions concerning these critical issues, ensuring that its objectives align with the evolving needs and challenges facing the Union. Overall, it serves as a key component in defining and enhancing the governance of the European Union.&lt;SEP&gt;The European Council is the institution that defines the overall political direction and priorities of the European Union.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-3fa5fe9ac042448be58de6c82bb33ea4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b0054dbaea0e7f90c303fe7d7a824d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20ac675fffdeba0fbc242b392d3af8da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e86452bf9fab5e4da73d81e6eadabb30&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a5ff05678672211287e9053ebcd9c1c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3acb107043f5850a72cf1b047a443296&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b71cdb20a8fa5befb7c30c90163cd416&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6370e960da03a6bbdee69f64993cdae6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-119d91aacb77775b61f5eddaf23771be&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b4fa1ad79284c6e1a9636113352a8e0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8f21b63428a38759e45ffcb10bac3d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ec0d2d3cbe2a53a3bbf6373c775edf2</data>
