    <node id="Training Data Sets">
      <data key="d0">Training Data Sets</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Training Data Sets are collections of data used to train AI models, required to be high-quality and relevant to the intended AI application.&lt;SEP&gt;Training Data Sets are the data used to train high-risk AI systems, influencing their performance and decision-making capabilities.&lt;SEP&gt;Training Data Sets refer to the collections of data used to develop, test, and validate AI systems, crucial for compliance with regulatory standards.&lt;SEP&gt;Training data sets are collections of data used to train AI models, which must meet quality criteria and governance protocols.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-cbe4515f5aa3b0876e436a8a0dffc23e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2f186d6b95e69680f63fabb65ad924a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-445327adc051facf545b6358f6f01466&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2fde742696dfc1372a034cc9cadcb58d</data>
