    <node id="Union Financial Services Law">
      <data key="d0">Union Financial Services Law</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Union Financial Services Law governs internal governance and risk management for regulated financial institutions, particularly concerning the provision of financial services and the use of AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Union Financial Services Law includes regulations that govern the operations, governance, and compliance obligations of financial institutions within the Union.&lt;SEP&gt;Union financial services law establishes regulations that financial institutions must follow regarding their governance and operational processes.&lt;SEP&gt;Union financial services law is a regulatory framework that governs the internal governance and processes of financial institutions in relation to high-risk AI systems.</data>
