    <node id="National Authorities">
      <data key="d0">National Authorities</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">National Authorities are government bodies in EU member states responsible for implementing and enforcing EU regulations at the national level.&lt;SEP&gt;National Authorities are responsible for local enforcement of regulations and have restricted access to sections of the EU database.&lt;SEP&gt;National Authorities are responsible for the supervision of credit institutions, acting under various EU directives to ensure financial regulation compliance.&lt;SEP&gt;National Authorities refer to government entities that are responsible for establishing and overseeing regulations related to AI safety and compliance in their regions.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d7f74259ac0ec20e9f3989df868f56b4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-711f6ce0c9e8f119b1813ffe001673da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f116a95954c59b63ce3149e6283ed8e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7859a0c655f74761757b416c3b50bf36</data>
