    </node>
    <node id="Competent Authorities">
      <data key="d0">Competent Authorities</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Competent Authorities are agencies or bodies designated by Member States to oversee the regulation of AI and operate the regulatory sandboxes.&lt;SEP&gt;Competent Authorities are designated regulatory bodies within the European Union tasked with overseeing the implementation and compliance of various regulations, particularly those concerning high-risk Artificial Intelligence (AI) systems and data protection laws. They play a critical role in ensuring that financial institutions and AI developers adhere to legal obligations by enforcing compliance with safety standards and overseeing the testing of AI systems.

These authorities possess the power to require necessary documentation, conduct oversight, and ensure the effective implementation of all relevant regulations regarding AI and data protection. They also have a role in managing AI sandboxes, which are structured environments designed for the testing and development of innovative AI technologies while ensuring that these technologies comply with established legal and safety requirements.

In addition, Competent Authorities oversee the implementation of biometric systems as per legal requirements throughout Member States, and they are integral in enforcing compliance with data protection laws and regulations. They are responsible for overseeing investigations and ensuring that there is compliance with reporting requirements related to serious incidents.

Furthermore, Competent Authorities are authorized governmental bodies allowed to use AI systems for law enforcement purposes, emphasizing their multifaceted responsibilities. Overall, they act as essential entities within Member States, tasked with enforcing regulations and ensuring compliance with EU laws across various sectors, including AI, data protection, and safety standards in the market.&lt;SEP&gt;Competent Authorities are national bodies that provide guidance, supervision, and support within the AI regulatory sandboxes to ensure compliance with regulations and assess risks.&lt;SEP&gt;Competent Authorities refer to official bodies responsible for overseeing compliance with regulations regarding high-risk AI systems.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-711f6ce0c9e8f119b1813ffe001673da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a67563c32c3414ab14ce22666bed23dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a21678b36bef336bf18e091bdfdb68f0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-00e7606a0fa9d588f18d67d02cfcf654&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b0c31436f0e7ce27ce5952aa2bf9ae5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0dc307b8b7cb1f0e39aa9b4b1839c408&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2c1d05b847c03fe702172f787883fc33&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-873c3732f26f3ace86c77cfec67991ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f77911358a1d821f6b1731fac6d2dbd6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50be48c46c67191e901c756873069fcb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9fc356102e8bbeed5152b8bb0cda2ff6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-577494efd5ce842563e6974b0da9707b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d08b537f9a5bb2b4f4bbdf442ba39bdd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-13b35a74627bd926656242d6545e09a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a46250ea72037444e96653239f2893b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ee1f186f5aed070bc8e6e813caed9967&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-475967c83e624bc711a9ff13e8150163&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-800752b66b6fe0cd70bb0290efc2fbbe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-95424b9dff57302628c496570b4baff4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8022b105f5e7e2d0ba74bbe75f31f87</data>
