    <node id="Chapter III, Section 2">
      <data key="d0">Chapter III, Section 2</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Chapter III, Section 2 of Regulation (EU) 2024/1689 encompasses a comprehensive set of requirements aimed at promoting the responsible application of artificial intelligence (AI) systems while ensuring their alignment with European values. This section outlines specific rules and technical specifications related to the implementation of safety standards for AI systems. It also details the necessary protocols for CE marking, emphasizing the importance of adherence to regulatory compliance to avoid penalties. Furthermore, Chapter III, Section 2 includes classifications for AI systems, encompassing risk assessments that AI systems must undergo to ensure they meet established criteria. Overall, this section serves as a critical component of the legislative framework governing the development and deployment of AI technologies within the European Union.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a64bfb94635a0df2f808b2f8a494bd3e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a5a3ae528d10c9d38e017d520ab6719&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-610573a7c194ad780ed97782200a740c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a4219a2a10d85ddd82f98b8d6267cb9b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-43e82a7af456b2ae813a7217f92c2008&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a69b68c9998277692ac6c6341fcdcac</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_112.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_3.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_80.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_102.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_108.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1747658093</data>
    </node>
