      <data key="d0">2 August 2031</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">2 August 2031 is the deadline set for the Commission to carry out an assessment of the AI Regulation enforcement and report the findings.&lt;SEP&gt;The date by which the Commission must assess the enforcement of AI-related regulations and report to relevant EU bodies.</data>
