    <node id="General-Purpose AI Model">
      <data key="d0">General-Purpose AI Model</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">The General-Purpose AI Model is an advanced type of artificial intelligence designed to perform a wide array of tasks across various applications and domains. These models are recognized for their versatility and are capable of completing diverse functions, making them suitable for a multitude of situations. Given their extensive functionalities, General-Purpose AI Models are subject to regulatory scrutiny to ensure they adhere to compliance protocols aimed at minimizing risks associated with their deployment.

These systems are evaluated for their capabilities and the systemic risks they may pose, with oversight provided by regulatory bodies such as The Commission, which assesses these models based on specific criteria. It is imperative that before their market introduction, General-Purpose AI Models comply with necessary guidelines to guarantee safe and ethical usage, emphasizing the importance of thorough consideration in both their deployment and governance.

While these models hold significant potential for innovation, they also necessitate vigilant management of the risks involved, highlighting the dual responsibility of leveraging their capabilities while addressing the societal implications of their use. Overall, General-Purpose AI Models serve as foundational frameworks adaptable to various applications, underscoring the critical need for careful evaluation and regulation to harness their benefits responsibly.&lt;SEP&gt;The general-purpose AI model refers to an artificial intelligence system designed for various applications, possibly including legal contexts.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-1fb0ee5d200ca5b71eb6d9f53ad070ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c49e78c25e30ed3a2557915010f14f3c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-873c3732f26f3ace86c77cfec67991ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-90efb8f063f236753e4794005afa2a0d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-decd01dd1bf25270eddf9979fe28678a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-447d51c65bac6d28fd62c36c3e70e08b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e23bb4c71b510fec0bbe6570de37cd5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fe0c14a128bfd78c4c5056f7102cc152&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1ef1c9ca92c002cf6ad36264fe1292c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7dbd41da6ea2a77fff5beb18c8e7c896&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-23ab4f338bfa06297d4c996d7d54dc70&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5406d942407c55f04629004d833f8196&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e519b84a1d0987cd3b0aab32a476aa33&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a0bef2c1dcc3d7b428c7611732f7ffc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c259012a2ff719418b0deb6cbd52130&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b89491b02af0a00cbc13f9e8df827a6d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f4ac0ccf9bd954306cee6efbfd342416</data>
