    <node id="Industry">
      <data key="d0">Industry</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Industry refers to commercial sectors that are represented in the advisory forum to provide insights into business practices and interests relevant to the Regulation.&lt;SEP&gt;Industry represents various sectors that utilize AI technologies and engage in developing codes of practice as part of regulatory compliance.&lt;SEP&gt;The industry encompasses businesses and enterprises that develop, deploy, or utilize AI systems in various sectors.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f76666cf495bb0f0810313fe42e2c882&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c259012a2ff719418b0deb6cbd52130&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4dc0271c68856282748506ff58069b0</data>
