      <data key="d2">Civil society encompasses non-governmental organizations and communities that represent the public interest and contribute to decision-making in the advisory forum.&lt;SEP&gt;Civil society refers to organizations and groups that represent the interests and views of the public concerning the impact of AI technologies.</data>
