    <node id="Floating Point Operations">
      <data key="d0">Floating Point Operations</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Floating Point Operations are a measure of computational work done in training AI models, used to determine their potential impact and classification.&lt;SEP&gt;Floating point operations are a measure of computational capacity, used to evaluate the capabilities of general-purpose AI models.</data>
