      <data key="d0">Training Data Set</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">The training data set consists of data used to train AI models, influencing their performance and capabilities.&lt;SEP&gt;The training data set is a collection of data used to train AI models, influencing their performance, capabilities, and potential biases.</data>
