    <node id="notified bodies">
      <data key="d0">notified bodies</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Notified bodies are designated organizations that assess and validate compliance of high-risk AI systems with the legal requirements set forth in regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Notified bodies are designated organizations that assess compliance and safety of high-risk AI systems as part of regulatory frameworks.&lt;SEP&gt;Notified bodies are organizations active in the conformity assessment procedures, which the Commission coordinates.&lt;SEP&gt;Notified bodies are organizations designated by Member States to evaluate compliance with regulations and facilitate market access for various providers.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-36cb0fd5abf1b169a8aa13021f58c7b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba662546e18e6e5f82c3cd1c5b4c3b75&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0461b38c664574f634a78148bfce0336&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8eae051373e28d701c4893438950556b</data>
