      <data key="d2">Risk Assessments involve the evaluation of potential risks associated with AI systems, particularly in law enforcement contexts.&lt;SEP&gt;Risk assessments involve evaluating the potential risk of individuals committing criminal offenses based on AI profiling and personal characteristics.&lt;SEP&gt;Risk assessments relate to the evaluation procedures for determining the likelihood of individuals or entities engaging in criminal activities based on various characteristics and behaviors.</data>
