    <node id="Risk Management System">
      <data key="d0">Risk Management System</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">A Risk Management System is a framework organizations use to identify, assess, and mitigate risks associated with their high-risk AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;A Risk Management System refers to a systematic approach intended to identify, assess, and mitigate risks associated with high-risk AI systems throughout their lifecycle.&lt;SEP&gt;The Risk Management System is a framework established to identify, assess, and mitigate risks associated with high-risk AI systems.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c32bc5fa5cdfa35a393a42535dc4fdfb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ca7c773df7242c37f506b8ad3db475b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ac68c725e087cb7c659f2dd75f0a6e34</data>
