    </node>
    <node id="Article 13">
      <data key="d0">Article 13</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Article 13 encompasses several significant details regarding the obligations and guidelines related to the processing of personal data and the deployment of high-risk AI systems within the framework of EU regulations. Specifically, Article 13 is part of Directive (EU) 2016/680, which outlines requirements for law enforcement concerning personal data handling. 

Additionally, Article 13 mandates that deployers of high-risk AI systems must meet specific information and training requirements. It emphasizes the necessity for providers to supply relevant information that allows for proper assessments of these AI systems. Furthermore, Article 13 details the regulations surrounding the testing and usage of AI systems, ensuring that they comply with data protection laws. Overall, Article 13 serves as a critical regulatory requirement that supports the effective and compliant integration of AI technologies, particularly in high-risk scenarios, ensuring that personal data is handled responsibly.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-de3f18a6d766d2baa57ae891b9da7741&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f6e14583352886a741ac1d51eada03a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a68b9cb2eff595118d2af9313b6c89f5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77a0a99b47c288a96d7474c796efb766&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78dcdae0f5d22df28405d8ae03e038d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9bece07e296fce9647a40a0dde904fe4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ca7c773df7242c37f506b8ad3db475b</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_60.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_27.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_9.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_26.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_93.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1747657955</data>
    </node>
