      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">The process of estimating and evaluating potential risks that may arise during the use of High-Risk AI Systems, including misuse scenarios.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4ca7c773df7242c37f506b8ad3db475b</data>
