      <data key="d0">Risk Management Measures</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Risk Management Measures refer to strategies and actions adopted to mitigate or eliminate identified risks associated with High-Risk AI Systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Risk Management Measures refer to structured approaches to identify, assess, and mitigate risks associated with high-risk AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Risk Management Measures refer to the strategies and procedures established to minimize and manage potential risks associated with high-risk AI systems, ensuring they operate safely and effectively.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4ca7c773df7242c37f506b8ad3db475b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-35a30c75209c0fbb0ca1bb4afe44c77d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a68b9cb2eff595118d2af9313b6c89f5</data>
