    <node id="European Union Law">
      <data key="d0">European Union Law</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">European Union Law encompasses the legal framework governing various activities within the EU, including legislation pertaining to AI systems and ethical research.&lt;SEP&gt;European Union Law encompasses the rules, regulations, and directives that govern the member states of the European Union, ensuring mutual legal standards and operational integration.&lt;SEP&gt;European Union Law refers to a set of legal regulations and directives applicable within member states that govern various sectors, including artificial intelligence testing and risk management.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-35a30c75209c0fbb0ca1bb4afe44c77d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ffd8df9d8eb9625dca23bc5f974e025&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a23e03a78af2035b69e69bd4fc65a435</data>
