      <data key="d0">Decision-Making</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Decision-Making is a process by which choices are made, could involve human decisions influenced by AI.&lt;SEP&gt;Decision-Making refers to the processes impacted by AI systems that can affect natural persons' lives and rights.</data>
