      <data key="d0">Conditions Fulfilled</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Conditions Fulfilled are criteria that outline when an AI system does not materially influence decision-making outcomes.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c5fb48082255c480535475ddb098366a</data>
