      <data key="d2">The Board is a consultative body assisting the Commission in formulating regulations for AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;The Board is responsible for advising and assisting the Commission and Member States on the application of regulations concerning market surveillance and AI models.&lt;SEP&gt;The Board is responsible for advising and assisting the Commission and Member States on the application of regulations concerning market surveillance and AI models.</data>
