      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">High-risk AI Systems are AI technologies that are subject to stringent requirements and oversight due to their potential impact on safety and rights.&lt;SEP&gt;High-risk AI systems are defined as systems that either serve as safety components of products or function independently, requiring strict regulatory oversight.&lt;SEP&gt;High-risk AI systems are defined by their potential implications and require stringent oversight and compliance measures.</data>
