    <node id="European Artificial Intelligence Board">
      <data key="d0">European Artificial Intelligence Board</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The European Artificial Intelligence Board is a body that provides guidance on the implementation of policies related to artificial intelligence in Europe.&lt;SEP&gt;The European Artificial Intelligence Board is responsible for providing guidelines and oversight related to the practical implementation of AI systems and their risk assessments.&lt;SEP&gt;The European Artificial Intelligence Board is established to oversee AI-related regulations and consists of one representative from each Member State, along with observers from the European Data Protection Supervisor and AI Office.&lt;SEP&gt;The European Artificial Intelligence Board is an organization aimed at promoting the understanding and appropriate use of AI technologies across the European Union.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7e28e08bfb7b1ae3208e2c91ea6f1e4e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8cb1edc11e8b8d0e952b15617a80f379&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d64a2a65aec35f8304efaaee30e0034d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21acb22d994b8f65ea3709a99eb85032</data>
