    <node id="Recital 53">
      <data key="d0">Recital 53</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Recital 53 refers to a specific part of the Regulation that outlines key points related to the protection of health and safety.&lt;SEP&gt;Recital 53 refers to a specific provision in a regulatory context, likely discussing guidelines or principles related to AI systems.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-739e3d9c7841d79a7701d630f8c7fa26&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8cb1edc11e8b8d0e952b15617a80f379</data>
