    <node id="Article 7(1)">
      <data key="d0">Article 7(1)</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Article 7(1) refers to a specific clause in the Regulation that deals with delegated acts relating to health, safety, and fundamental rights.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-739e3d9c7841d79a7701d630f8c7fa26</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_6.json</data>
