    <node id="Paragraph 3">
      <data key="d0">Paragraph 3</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Paragraph 3 emphasizes the conditions under which Member States may implement additional laws on biometric systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Paragraph 3 is a section of the Regulation that outlines specific conditions related to health and safety and how amendments should be handled.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-50be48c46c67191e901c756873069fcb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-739e3d9c7841d79a7701d630f8c7fa26</data>
