    </node>
    <node id="Importers">
      <data key="d0">Importers</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Importers are entities responsible for ensuring that high-risk AI systems comply with regulatory requirements before placing them on the market.&lt;SEP&gt;Importers are entities responsible for the storage and transport of high-risk AI systems and must ensure compliance with relevant regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Importers are entities that bring high-risk AI systems into the market and share responsibility for compliance with regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Importers are operators involved in the AI systems value chain who may take on specific obligations under the New Legislative Framework.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9fc356102e8bbeed5152b8bb0cda2ff6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-73fd7e801c2d8d41361f6b16b45c6ed0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-197c7357cf5fefe6ca4e08f847ff6a75&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-85fb9638473c0974347ccab540b99b7b</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_23.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_24.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_83.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1747657846</data>
    </node>
    <node id="EU">
      <data key="d0">EU</data>
      <data key="d1">geo</data>
      <data key="d2">The European Union (EU) is a political and economic union comprising member states primarily located in Europe. It plays a significant role in promoting economic cooperation and unity among these countries. The EU is actively involved in creating and enacting legislation and regulations, such as directives and acts, that apply across its member states. These legal frameworks cover a wide range of sectors, including technology, finance, personal data protection, product safety, and standards.

Among its various responsibilities, the EU has established regulations specifically aimed at high-risk artificial intelligence (AI) systems and developed a comprehensive framework to safeguard personal data. This commitment to common regulations highlights the EU's importance as a crucial actor in governing contemporary issues that affect its member countries. Overall, the EU's multifaceted regulatory approach reflects its dedication to ensuring the safety and well-being of its member states and their citizens.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0a68b7c657291244b183bd644e6df395&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68df7ac042ba1913236779113868f934&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-675b49fdde07175ec9a1afb693d1d877&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9fc356102e8bbeed5152b8bb0cda2ff6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8efd21db4fc63a879493cbb376ae904&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ccb2a1ed4b082f01bfe6ddfd9cb4ffac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46418d497e0c090818a97380d173293d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1265df2d2f07835cf2aadd7299c694a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-00e7606a0fa9d588f18d67d02cfcf654&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2806e288e0b71013209c4ad85ecaa38b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d6ed86abb2e8f0e12897e923d1e9964</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_60.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_23.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_131.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_143.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_66.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_18.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_87.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_49.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_51.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_10.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_108.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1747658080</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Annex IV">
      <data key="d0">Annex IV</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Annex IV is a crucial component of the legislative framework concerning high-risk AI systems. It contains technical documentation that is essential for compliance with legal standards, detailing the requirements and guidelines necessary for effective post-market monitoring and documentation of these systems. Annex IV outlines the minimum elements needed in the technical documentation, ensuring transparency and accountability within the context of high-risk AI applications. Furthermore, it encompasses a framework or list relevant to compliance requirements, which may be amended by the Commission as needed. Additionally, Annex IV specifies the requirements concerning conformity assessments, further emphasizing its role in the governance of high-risk AI systems. Overall, Annex IV provides a comprehensive guide for stakeholders to navigate the complexities of compliance and documentation in the high-risk AI sector, while also indicating that the provisions it contains do not constitute substantial modifications.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9fc356102e8bbeed5152b8bb0cda2ff6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41e5d20a8e9427a4698b84f758676994&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-55bfb9287798720e37fcd8bae961e88b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f56b40e98f8949a37c3ab283b01f7050&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c4d62babb1c5a144faeae6ac2f13628&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fdf8a675497acfbeb420b95621b7cb31&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-36cb0fd5abf1b169a8aa13021f58c7b2</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_23.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_72.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_43.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_78.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_11.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1747657909</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Authorised Representative">
      <data key="d0">Authorised Representative</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">An authorised representative is a designated individual or entity appointed by an AI model provider to ensure compliance with regulatory tasks in the Union.&lt;SEP&gt;An authorised representative is an entity or individual appointed by the provider of the high-risk AI system to act on their behalf in matters of compliance.&lt;SEP&gt;The authorised representative is an appointed individual or entity that acts on behalf of the provider of high-risk AI systems to ensure compliance with EU regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;The authorised representative is a designated individual within the Union responsible for ensuring compliance of high-risk AI systems from foreign providers.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9fc356102e8bbeed5152b8bb0cda2ff6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-873c3732f26f3ace86c77cfec67991ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3fc29985a43f3bd521b3a1c9eb9ba756&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f77911358a1d821f6b1731fac6d2dbd6</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_22.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_54.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_23.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_82.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="EU declaration of conformity">
      <data key="d0">EU declaration of conformity</data>
      <data key="d1">document</data>
      <data key="d2">The EU declaration of conformity certifies that high-risk AI systems meet established safety and performance standards and must be kept for 10 years by importers.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-85fb9638473c0974347ccab540b99b7b</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_23.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="competent authorities">
      <data key="d0">competent authorities</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Competent authorities are official bodies responsible for overseeing and regulating the activities related to AI projects and ensuring compliance with laws.&lt;SEP&gt;Competent authorities are regulatory bodies responsible for overseeing compliance and safety regarding high-risk AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Competent authorities are regulatory bodies that oversee the compliance of high-risk AI systems and may request documentation to ensure conformity.&lt;SEP&gt;Competent authorities are the legal bodies responsible for ensuring adherence to regulations related to AI technologies.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b567607dbb431b0d294cd02679760039&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8af2de29a8b78dd2b512b6eb64d912a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-85fb9638473c0974347ccab540b99b7b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2612abd3c26dca69a0acec30add3ef15</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_22.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_54.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_23.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_59.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="importers">
      <data key="d0">importers</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Importers are entities responsible for bringing high-risk AI systems into a market, managing their storage and transportation.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-85fb9638473c0974347ccab540b99b7b</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_23.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="technical documentation">
      <data key="d0">technical documentation</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Technical documentation includes the comprehensive information that demonstrates a high-risk AI system's compliance with regulatory requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;Technical documentation is the comprehensive record that details how high-risk AI systems comply with legal requirements, including assessment and conformity processes.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-36cb0fd5abf1b169a8aa13021f58c7b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-85fb9638473c0974347ccab540b99b7b</data>
