    <node id="2 August 2025">
      <data key="d0">2 August 2025</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">2 August 2025 is the cut-off date for the AI Office to finalize or deem the adequacy of the codes of practice before further actions are taken.&lt;SEP&gt;2 August 2025 marks the cutoff date for the release of general-purpose AI models subject to the specified regulation.&lt;SEP&gt;2 August 2025 is the date set for the application of the provisions outlined in the Regulation.&lt;SEP&gt;2 August 2025 marks the date by which critical governance structures and compliance systems related to AI must be operational.&lt;SEP&gt;2 August 2025 is the deadline by which Member States must establish communication methods for competent authorities, as outlined in the regulation.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-22275ba6343521309923fef233affa2a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f6de18717bcb0167956be85a15dd210f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40a9e2a0fc4601f4b3d4f583384b6a06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ad9752391e53e840a2d8ac0861f8948&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-47ce3f90343791af10ffae2a7848f26e</data>
