    </node>
    <node id="Implementing Act">
      <data key="d0">Implementing Act</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">The Implementing Act outlines the structure, level of fees, and recoverable costs associated with the enforcement of the Regulation.&lt;SEP&gt;The Implementing Act refers to a legal mechanism aimed at establishing the procedures and regulations necessary for the application of codes of practice within the Union.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-daa2a9a43bd7a2482ad876b406b9e9c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5ea6a588c10ad2fe493ec8cc1913f72d</data>
