    <node id="Decision No 768/2008/EC">
      <data key="d0">Decision No 768/2008/EC</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Decision No 768/2008/EC is a legislative decision by the European Parliament and Council concerning the marketing of products.&lt;SEP&gt;Decision No 768/2008/EC is part of the New Legislative Framework that complements existing law regarding high-risk AI systems in the EU.&lt;SEP&gt;Decision No 768/2008/EC outlines the regulatory framework for conformity assessments in the European Union, impacting how notified bodies operate.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c28a81721b7de3ef4442495cc499b1cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-97ee5867d3c03f24001b650ad752686d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a5ff05678672211287e9053ebcd9c1c6</data>
