    <node id="Directive 97/7/EC">
      <data key="d0">Directive 97/7/EC</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Council Directive 97/7/EC governs the protection of consumers in distance contracts, ensuring informed consent and transparent practices.&lt;SEP&gt;Directive 97/7/EC is a legislative measure aimed at protecting consumers in distance contracts and e-commerce, ensuring transparency and fairness in online transactions.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-41d5cbcbecdcfde489e01bbfe08dc447&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-17045c951f494f621b2305960aade53f</data>
