      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Council Directive 2002/65/EC concerns the protection of consumers in distance selling, ensuring they are informed and protected throughout the purchasing process.&lt;SEP&gt;Directive 2002/65/EC outlines consumer protection in the field of distance selling of financial services to consumers.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-41d5cbcbecdcfde489e01bbfe08dc447&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-17045c951f494f621b2305960aade53f</data>
