      <data key="d0">Obligations of Providers</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Obligations of Providers describe the responsibilities of AI system developers in ensuring direct risks are mitigated during development.&lt;SEP&gt;Obligations of providers refer to the responsibilities that organizations have to ensure transparency and accountability in the usage of AI systems.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e7e1bc352c7c8d3a7ba58b9b1a4f9f37&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de3f18a6d766d2baa57ae891b9da7741</data>
