      <data key="d0">Committee</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Committee is a specialized group formed to assist the Commission, operating under the guidelines established by Regulation (EU) No 182/2011.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e37c30ee0e0a87b8ea9630ea20f092fa</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_98.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Union Technical Documentation Assessment Certificates">
      <data key="d0">Union Technical Documentation Assessment Certificates</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Union Technical Documentation Assessment Certificates are certificates that validate compliance with specific Union standards, issued by notified bodies for technical documentation.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f2a5e7031602556ef7d57e2811f58992</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_45.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Quality Management System Approvals">
      <data key="d0">Quality Management System Approvals</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Quality Management System Approvals refer to certifications granted by notified bodies indicating that an organization's quality management system meets defined criteria.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f2a5e7031602556ef7d57e2811f58992</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_45.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Notifying Authority">
      <data key="d0">Notifying Authority</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">A Notifying Authority is responsible for overseeing the assessment, designation, and monitoring of conformity assessment bodies within Member States.&lt;SEP&gt;The Notifying Authority is a public entity that Member States are mandated to appoint for the supervision of regulation enforcement within the context of compliance and standard procedures. This governmental body is responsible for overseeing notified bodies and ensuring that they adhere to Union regulations and standards. 

The Notifying Authority plays a critical role in recognizing these notified bodies and monitoring their activities to verify that they meet necessary regulatory requirements. Additionally, it is tasked with overseeing the notification process of conformity assessment bodies in various Member States. One of its significant responsibilities includes providing the Commission with relevant information concerning the competence of notified bodies as well as their notifications.

Specifically, the Notifying Authority also assesses and monitors conformity assessment bodies related to artificial intelligence (AI) systems, ensuring that proper conformity assessment procedures are adhered to, thus maintaining compliance with existing regulations governing AI technologies.&lt;SEP&gt;The notifying authority is an official body responsible for investigating compliance issues and managing the designation of notified bodies, ensuring they meet regulatory requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;The notifying authority is responsible for issuing notifications regarding changes to notified bodies and ensuring compliance with regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;The notifying authority is a regulatory entity that oversees the assessment, designation, notification, and monitoring activities related to notified bodies and providers.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d1d974005cd87fc21678c732472ee11a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f55b689ece7aa049c38fdc38018dba8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff611ee371ea780574e9c16859c31f2f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f5fc2b531499a81e154196ee1e86ac6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c237e1a0b42db9afb10cc8a045dbb751&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1dbe8a4749b15b91fcb1062fee4fa778&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34f79a9fca1518856b24fdcb7e59f040&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-97182f6b8815d40f51faf3e8eaeb7c7d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c712c6235ebe0b7ee5102919bbe87d08&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2a5e7031602556ef7d57e2811f58992&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8caee37338a6383c30fe06ea2b3e4761</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_36.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_33.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_153.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_37.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_28.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_3.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_45.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_34.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_29.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1747657631</data>
