      <data key="d0">Quality Management Systems</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Quality Management Systems are frameworks for managing and improving organizational processes and ensuring product or service quality.&lt;SEP&gt;Quality management systems are structured frameworks designed to ensure that organizations meet product and service quality requirements under relevant laws.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-bc662d7e26079b23ad5010b8671bfb7d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2a5e7031602556ef7d57e2811f58992</data>
