      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Market Integration of AI Models refers to the methods through which AI models are introduced and made available to users, including APIs and direct downloads.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-161f3120961644fbdc17c7b09b46e54b</data>
