    <node id="authorised representative">
      <data key="d0">authorised representative</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">The authorised representative acts on behalf of the provider to ensure compliance with the Regulation and is accountable to competent authorities.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8af2de29a8b78dd2b512b6eb64d912a6</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_22.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="logs">
      <data key="d0">logs</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Logs are automatically generated records by a high-risk AI system that provide data for compliance and safety verification.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8af2de29a8b78dd2b512b6eb64d912a6</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_22.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="certificate">
      <data key="d0">certificate</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">A certificate is an official document that confirms that a provider's system meets predefined standards, allowing it to operate in a particular domain.&lt;SEP&gt;A certificate issued by a notified body indicates compliance of a high-risk AI system with regulatory requirements.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8af2de29a8b78dd2b512b6eb64d912a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b341fa074527a308a2434a3c68244d02</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_36.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_22.json</data>
