      <data key="d0">termination of mandate</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Termination of a mandate occurs when a provider ends its obligations or responsibilities defined by the regulation, requiring notification to relevant bodies.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c361162e59f587f531364714bb3e3c4c</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_22.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="European Union Regulation (EU) 2016/679">
      <data key="d0">European Union Regulation (EU) 2016/679</data>
      <data key="d1">legal</data>
      <data key="d2">Regulation (EU) 2016/679, known as the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR), provides guidelines on the collection and processing of personal data within the EU.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-699b82035d71a633a86a67090e5a61e8</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_59.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="European Union Regulation (EU) 2018/1725">
      <data key="d0">European Union Regulation (EU) 2018/1725</data>
      <data key="d1">legal</data>
      <data key="d2">Regulation (EU) 2018/1725 is concerned with the protection of personal data in the EU and applies to the processing of personal data in the context of Union institutions and bodies.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-699b82035d71a633a86a67090e5a61e8</data>
