    </node>
    <node id="Public Safety">
      <data key="d0">Public Safety</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Public Safety includes measures and policies put in place to protect the well-being and health of the public in various contexts, which can be enhanced by AI systems.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-699b82035d71a633a86a67090e5a61e8</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_59.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Public Health">
      <data key="d0">Public Health</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Public Health focuses on the health of the population as a whole, including disease prevention, control, and improvement of health care systems through innovative technologies like AI.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-699b82035d71a633a86a67090e5a61e8</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_59.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Energy Sustainability">
      <data key="d0">Energy Sustainability</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Energy Sustainability emphasizes the need for energy systems that meet current demands without compromising future generations, with potential AI contributions to efficiency.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-699b82035d71a633a86a67090e5a61e8</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_59.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Transport Systems">
      <data key="d0">Transport Systems</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Transport Systems refer to the frameworks and networks that ensure efficient movement of people and goods, which can benefit from AI implementations for safety and resilience.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-699b82035d71a633a86a67090e5a61e8</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_59.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Data Subjects">
      <data key="d0">Data Subjects</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Data Subjects are individuals whose personal data is being processed, and they have rights and protections under laws such as Directive (EU) 2016/680.&lt;SEP&gt;Data Subjects are individuals whose personal data is collected and processed, and their rights must be protected during AI system experimentation.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-737358b61293029e1a6d7326160654fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-699b82035d71a633a86a67090e5a61e8</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_94.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_59.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1747657652</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Union data protection law">
      <data key="d0">Union data protection law</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Union data protection law encompasses regulations and guidelines that aim to protect personal data and the privacy of individuals within the EU.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-800752b66b6fe0cd70bb0290efc2fbbe</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_59.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Article 39">
      <data key="d0">Article 39</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Article 39 of Regulation (EU) 2018/1725 outlines specific provisions regarding personal data processing during sandbox experimentation.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-800752b66b6fe0cd70bb0290efc2fbbe</data>
