    </node>
    <node id="Sandbox Experimentation">
      <data key="d0">Sandbox Experimentation</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Sandbox Experimentation involves the testing and experimentation of AI systems within the regulatory sandbox framework to ensure safety and compliance with laws.&lt;SEP&gt;Sandbox experimentation refers to a controlled environment for testing and validating innovative processes, particularly in AI systems within the frameworks of data protection law.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-800752b66b6fe0cd70bb0290efc2fbbe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-85bb41c1db2d2e1883172e505d5f7b71</data>
