      <data key="d0">Regulatory Sandbox</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">A Regulatory Sandbox is a controlled environment where new technologies, such as AI systems, can be tested under regulatory supervision to ensure safety and compliance.</data>
