      <data key="d0">Transitional Period</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">The Transitional Period is a phase during which compliance with the new Regulation is being encouraged among providers of high-risk AI systems.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-70337c5367702b9a8ef4dd8a241aa46d</data>
