      <data key="d0">Regulation for High-Risk AI Systems</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Regulation for High-Risk AI Systems is the set of guidelines and obligations designed to govern the use and development of AI technologies that present significant risks to society.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-70337c5367702b9a8ef4dd8a241aa46d</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_178.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Directive (EU) 2022/2557">
      <data key="d0">Directive (EU) 2022/2557</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Directive (EU) 2022/2557 focuses on the resilience of critical entities and replaces the previous directive from 2008, emphasizing enhancements in critical infrastructure.&lt;SEP&gt;Directive (EU) 2022/2557 is a legal framework within the European Union that addresses the management of critical digital infrastructure.&lt;SEP&gt;Directive (EU) 2022/2557 is a legislative act concerning the resilience of critical infrastructure to threats and emergencies.&lt;SEP&gt;The Directive (EU) 2022/2557 focuses on the resilience of critical entities and pertains to law enforcement and safety regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Directive (EU) 2022/2557 relates to the establishment of laws regarding the protection of individuals' rights in the context of AI and technology.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d91755cda6acde2b40257e6d4cef1695&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3266d68b5262e6852cabbe36178dec96&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ec6a8294e2a2ad2569029d260c4d7673&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a23e03a78af2035b69e69bd4fc65a435&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6badc71855b10bbd17a31c7dfef0c442</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_3.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_55.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_33.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1747657223</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Critical Infrastructure">
      <data key="d0">Critical Infrastructure</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Critical Infrastructure refers to essential systems and assets that are crucial for the functioning of society and the economy. This includes vital services such as energy, transportation, communication, road traffic, water supply, gas, heating, and electricity. The disruption of these critical services can threaten public safety, harm health, damage property, and endanger the environment. Given the importance of these systems, there is a need for special consideration in the registration of high-risk AI systems, highlighting their significance within the framework of public safety and economic security. This definition aligns with various legal frameworks, including those outlined in EU law, which emphasize the necessity of protecting these essential systems from disruption to ensure the continued well-being of the community.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d91755cda6acde2b40257e6d4cef1695&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c9405f93ec3e0ccf6209ed15ef0263f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ec6a8294e2a2ad2569029d260c4d7673&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a23e03a78af2035b69e69bd4fc65a435&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fe76292b9a553c383dab6b0a4a67cee8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-166a35f517674f4ceba2754c65f88c5f</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_3.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_55.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_33.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_131.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1747657208</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Safety Components">
      <data key="d0">Safety Components</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Safety Components are essential elements that play a critical role in ensuring the reliable and safe operation of products, particularly in the fields of artificial intelligence (AI) and robotics. They are designed to protect the physical integrity of critical infrastructure and to promote the health and safety of individuals. Safety Components encompass crucial systems that not only enhance operational safety but also ensure compliance with relevant regulations governing AI systems. These components are integral to the functionality of AI systems, contributing to their safety and adherence to safety requirements as stipulated by regulatory frameworks. Overall, Safety Components are vital for safeguarding the overall safety of various products across diverse applications.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7eb5283f4e280f1ec77650d624699286&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d7805654ce0fe0d8d9b6ba008562d2aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ec6a8294e2a2ad2569029d260c4d7673&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a4219a2a10d85ddd82f98b8d6267cb9b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5ab1f3b6cbb052c58ff3b9fc75a6d7a2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-18cf1aa30864348514b20fe64038fba8</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_55.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_50.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_104.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_47.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_108.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1747658047</data>
    </node>
