    <node id="Annex XIII">
      <data key="d0">Annex XIII</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Annex XIII outlines specific criteria and benchmarks to assess the impact capabilities of AI models.&lt;SEP&gt;Annex XIII provides the criteria for assessing whether a general-purpose AI model presents systemic risks and is subject to updates by The Commission.&lt;SEP&gt;Annex XIII specifies the criteria for determining which general-purpose AI models present systemic risks and may be updated by the Commission.</data>
