    </node>
    <node id="Freedom of Assembly and Association">
      <data key="d0">Freedom of Assembly and Association</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Freedom of Assembly and Association grants individuals the right to gather and collectively voice their opinions or interests.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0e284955c1d36330bd14d117bb417611</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_48.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Right to Non-Discrimination">
      <data key="d0">Right to Non-Discrimination</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">The Right to Non-Discrimination ensures that individuals are treated equally without bias based on race, gender, or other characteristics.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0e284955c1d36330bd14d117bb417611</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_48.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Right to Education">
      <data key="d0">Right to Education</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">The Right to Education guarantees access to education for all individuals, recognizing its importance for personal and societal development.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0e284955c1d36330bd14d117bb417611</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_48.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Consumer Protection">
      <data key="d0">Consumer Protection</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Consumer Protection rights are designed to safeguard buyers against unfair practices in the marketplace.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0e284955c1d36330bd14d117bb417611</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_48.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Workers Rights">
      <data key="d0">Workers Rights</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Workers' Rights refer to the rights that protect individuals in their workplace, including fair treatment, safe conditions, and fair compensation.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0e284955c1d36330bd14d117bb417611</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_48.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Rights of Persons with Disabilities">
      <data key="d0">Rights of Persons with Disabilities</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Rights of Persons with Disabilities ensure that individuals with disabilities have equitable access to opportunities and accommodations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0e284955c1d36330bd14d117bb417611</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_48.json</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Gender Equality">
      <data key="d0">Gender Equality</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Gender Equality refers to the state of equal access to resources and opportunities irrespective of gender.&lt;SEP&gt;Gender Equality refers to the state of equal access to resources and opportunities regardless of gender, addressing social, economic, and political disparities.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0e284955c1d36330bd14d117bb417611&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40f3761e589fb7702938fd4fbbecfdcc</data>
