      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Directive 2014/32/EU is a legislative act by the European Parliament aimed at harmonizing laws related to measuring instruments across EU member states.&lt;SEP&gt;Directive 2014/32/EU relates to the harmonization of laws regarding measuring instruments made available on the market within the EU.</data>
