      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Decision No 1673/2006/EC is another legislative decision made by the Council of the European Union previously relevant to EU council decisions.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-cdc616126c9eed60b2893f6f0c5a24b1</data>
