      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Military Purposes include activities or systems used in the defense sector, often governed by specific international laws and regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Military Purposes indicate activities or applications that relate to defense and national security, which are excluded from certain AI regulations outlined in the document.</data>
