      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">National Security involves the measures taken by a state to ensure its survival and protect its citizens from threats, which influences the regulation of AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;National Security refers to the measures taken by a state to protect its sovereignty, territorial integrity, and citizens.&lt;SEP&gt;National security encompasses the measures taken by a state to protect its citizens, economy, and institutions against threats, which may involve the use of AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;National Security refers to the state of being free from threat or danger, concerning the policies of member states.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5981afe4b9fb547c64f49e76b1d9c0a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-13991bdab077b3114e8913f89a1371e5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3105f8ed20ed5608a4571fe7b1d8f942&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ffa7662f1a996e8ed97ec3caf0ae564</data>
