      <data key="d2">CENELEC works within the advisory forum to ensure electrotechnical standards are aligned with AI regulatory frameworks.&lt;SEP&gt;The European Committee for Electrotechnical Standardization (CENELEC) focuses on standardization in the electrotechnical sector as it relates to the Regulation.</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
