      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">National Data Protection Authorities oversee the implementation of data protection laws and regulations, including those related to biometric identification.&lt;SEP&gt;The National Data Protection Authority oversees compliance with data protection regulations and reviews the use of post-remote biometric identification systems.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4988a00689afb1245e0f0ce4ceef5921&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2187eb3476528ac7c75b571eb3844f0e</data>
