    <node id="New Legislative Framework">
      <data key="d0">New Legislative Framework</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">A framework established to ensure that products comply with EU law, especially concerning high-risk AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;The New Legislative Framework provides a foundation for product legislation in the EU, ensuring that various legal acts can apply to a single product, enhancing market safety and compliance.&lt;SEP&gt;The New Legislative Framework provides guidelines for product safety and market regulation, particularly in relation to AI systems integrated within products.&lt;SEP&gt;The New Legislative Framework refers to a regulatory framework designed to ensure legal certainty and compliance in the context of AI systems.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-17ccf2ddbeca1f4e8b771a2316b7d16c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca3e6894a9009f1db207c0ec639d8a39&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6bf82c08e44c3a6e12c9472e052df840&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-197c7357cf5fefe6ca4e08f847ff6a75</data>
