    <node id="Sensitive Operational Data">
      <data key="d0">Sensitive Operational Data</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Sensitive operational data includes confidential information related to the activities of law enforcement, border control, immigration, and asylum authorities that must remain protected under certain conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;Sensitive operational data pertains to information related to criminal investigation activities, the disclosure of which could compromise legal processes.&lt;SEP&gt;Sensitive operational data refers to critical information that must be protected, especially for law enforcement authorities.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-54948128ea5a4b84a219d7dbaa346a50&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-75ec68339f2da8ef06976767a0d5b494&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ac98f64f8751ad51246ca16d843f030</data>
