      <data key="d0">Bilateral or Multilateral Confidentiality Arrangements</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Bilateral or multilateral confidentiality arrangements are agreements between two or more parties to protect the confidentiality of exchanged information, ensuring security during international cooperation.&lt;SEP&gt;These arrangements are agreements between two or more countries to maintain the confidentiality of exchanged information, establishing a legal basis for cooperation.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-75ec68339f2da8ef06976767a0d5b494&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d9317b056c2a260423c79e368903cde7</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_78.json</data>
