      <data key="d2">Member States are individual countries within the European Union that are responsible for the establishment and operation of AI regulatory sandboxes and other policies.&lt;SEP&gt;Member States' relevant authorities work in conjunction with the Commission to implement regulations related to AI systems and data sharing.</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
