      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Article 9(2) discusses risks to health and safety or fundamental rights that may arise from the use of high-risk AI systems, particularly in relation to misuse.&lt;SEP&gt;Article 9(2) refers to specific regulations concerning the health and safety or fundamental rights related to high-risk AI systems.</data>
