      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Performance Metrics refer to the criteria used to evaluate the accuracy, robustness, and cybersecurity of high-risk AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Performance metrics are quantifiable measures used to evaluate the effectiveness and reliability of high-risk AI systems throughout their lifecycle.</data>
