    <node id="AI Regulation">
      <data key="d0">AI Regulation</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">AI Regulation pertains to legislation set by the EU to govern the use and development of artificial intelligence technologies, addressing standards, accountability, and safety.&lt;SEP&gt;AI Regulation refers to the legal framework that governs the use and management of Artificial Intelligence, including provisions for compliance and penalties.&lt;SEP&gt;AI Regulation refers to the legal framework and guidelines governing the development, deployment, and monitoring of artificial intelligence systems to ensure safety and compliance with existing laws.&lt;SEP&gt;AI Regulation refers to the legal framework governing the application and implementation of artificial intelligence systems, including standards and obligations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b235644744fa597c94328afbeaa7e56b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d08b537f9a5bb2b4f4bbdf442ba39bdd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-00e7606a0fa9d588f18d67d02cfcf654&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40a9e2a0fc4601f4b3d4f583384b6a06</data>
