      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Risk Assessment is the process that evaluates the risks associated with a serious incident involving AI systems, necessary for ensuring safety and compliance.&lt;SEP&gt;Risk Assessment is the process that providers must perform to evaluate and manage the risks associated with serious incidents involving AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Risk assessment involves evaluating potential risks, including those over financial services and social support systems, often influenced by AI technologies.</data>
