      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Regulation (EU) 2017/745 establishes rules for medical devices within the EU, ensuring health and safety standards.&lt;SEP&gt;Regulation (EU) 2017/745 is a legislative framework addressing medical devices, influencing how modifications to high-risk AI systems are interpreted.&lt;SEP&gt;This regulation concerns the safety and performance of medical devices within the EU and impacts how AI systems are assessed.&lt;SEP&gt;Regulation (EU) 2017/745 refers to the European legislation concerning medical devices, outlining the requirements for safety, health, and fundamental rights.&lt;SEP&gt;This regulation concerns medical devices and sets requirements for their compliance in the Union market.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a0779dfb4a5c0f82f05a67985fe0224a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04f1483cdf6b84729e33ebc4a611375b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8efd21db4fc63a879493cbb376ae904&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a8bd64d122f5a09e9e3859bf77c6931&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca3e6894a9009f1db207c0ec639d8a39</data>
