      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Regulation (EU) 2017/746 pertains to in vitro diagnostic medical devices, establishing criteria and compliance mandates for these products.&lt;SEP&gt;Regulation (EU) 2017/746 pertains to in-vitro diagnostic medical devices, setting requirements for their safety and performance.&lt;SEP&gt;This regulation relates to in vitro diagnostic medical devices in the EU, influencing the classification of AI systems in healthcare settings.&lt;SEP&gt;This regulation addresses in vitro diagnostic medical devices and establishes specific standards for their operation in the Union.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ca3e6894a9009f1db207c0ec639d8a39&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8efd21db4fc63a879493cbb376ae904&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a0779dfb4a5c0f82f05a67985fe0224a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04f1483cdf6b84729e33ebc4a611375b</data>
