      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">An emotion recognition system is a type of AI used to identify and process human emotions through various modalities.&lt;SEP&gt;The Emotion Recognition System is an AI technology designed to identify or infer the emotions or intentions of individuals based on biometric data.&lt;SEP&gt;An emotion recognition system is an AI system aimed at inferring emotions or intentions of individuals based on biometric data.</data>
