      <data key="d2">The European Data Protection Supervisor acts as the competent authority overseeing the supervision of Union institutions, bodies, offices, or agencies as per the regulation.&lt;SEP&gt;Union institutions, bodies, offices, or agencies are entities established under EU law to assist in governance and public administration.</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
