    <node id="Complaint">
      <data key="d0">Complaint</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">A Complaint is an official statement made by a Downstream Provider alleging an infringement of the Regulation regarding AI models, requiring a detailed explanation and rationale.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-18d33fd192f06f727ac6bb21becbaa57</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_89.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1747464861</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Physical States">
      <data key="d0">Physical States</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Physical states encompass various conditions of individuals that do not pertain to emotions, such as pain, fatigue, etc., which are mentioned as exclusions in the emotion recognition context.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-61cbf514bcfe4869e269c00a2dc9e712</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_18.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1747464880</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Facial Expressions">
      <data key="d0">Facial Expressions</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Facial expressions are visual manifestations of emotions that can be analyzed to infer psychological states, such as smiles or frowns.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-61cbf514bcfe4869e269c00a2dc9e712</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_18.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1747464880</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Gestures">
      <data key="d0">Gestures</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Gestures are physical movements of a person that can convey emotional states or intentions, such as the movement of hands or arms.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-61cbf514bcfe4869e269c00a2dc9e712</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_18.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1747464880</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Voice Characteristics">
      <data key="d0">Voice Characteristics</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Voice characteristics refer to acoustic features such as tone, volume, and pitch that can reflect a person's emotional state.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-61cbf514bcfe4869e269c00a2dc9e712</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_18.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1747464880</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Professional Pilots">
      <data key="d0">Professional Pilots</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Professional pilots are individuals trained to operate aircraft, who may be monitored for their physical state to prevent accidents.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-61cbf514bcfe4869e269c00a2dc9e712</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_18.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1747464880</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Drivers">
      <data key="d0">Drivers</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Drivers are individuals who operate vehicles and may also be monitored for fatigue to enhance safety during transportation.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-61cbf514bcfe4869e269c00a2dc9e712</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_18.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1747464880</data>
