      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Directive 2002/14/EC of the European Parliament sets out the framework for informing and consulting employees within the European Union regarding workplace changes.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c664ec81872dda212b64d449aa7a2014</data>
