      <data key="d0">Regulations (EU) 2016/679 and 2018/1725</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">These regulations establish legal frameworks in the EU for the processing of personal data, focusing on individuals' rights and protections.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-602b68fe088482c0037845fc0b520c30</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_70.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1747464901</data>
