    <node id="Article 9(1) of Regulation (EU) 2016/679">
      <data key="d0">Article 9(1) of Regulation (EU) 2016/679</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Article 9(1) of Regulation (EU) 2016/679 addresses the specific exemptions and prohibitions concerning the processing of personal data, including biometric data.&lt;SEP&gt;This regulation article addresses the use and protection of sensitive personal data, influencing the classification of biometric systems.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b65e9562dd645622f1390ba1863fee19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc038db2f25d511bf84cccc9550e10c2</data>
