      <data key="d5">1747657107</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Recital 87">
      <data key="d0">Recital 87</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Recital 87 specifies the conditions under which product manufacturers are regarded as providers of a high-risk AI system.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b4329be6d4972c392a3a71593d402998</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_25.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1747657107</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Initial Provider">
      <data key="d0">Initial Provider</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">An initial provider is the original distributor or manufacturer of an AI system before any modifications that change its risk classification occur.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b4329be6d4972c392a3a71593d402998</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_25.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1747657107</data>
    </node>
    <node id="technical access">
      <data key="d0">technical access</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Technical access refers to the necessary information and assistance required for providers of high-risk AI systems to meet regulatory obligations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6c9021d6cb53dceeddd1e648d3e37fbc</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_25.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1747657107</data>
    </node>
    <node id="initial provider">
      <data key="d0">initial provider</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">The initial provider is the entity responsible for making available necessary information and technical access in relation to high-risk AI systems under the Regulation.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6c9021d6cb53dceeddd1e648d3e37fbc</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_25.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1747657107</data>
    </node>
    <node id="new providers">
      <data key="d0">new providers</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">New providers refer to entities that work under the guidance of the initial providers to ensure compliance with the obligations set out in the Regulation.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6c9021d6cb53dceeddd1e648d3e37fbc</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_25.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1747657107</data>
    </node>
    <node id="product manufacturer">
      <data key="d0">product manufacturer</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">The product manufacturer is considered the provider of high-risk AI systems when these systems are marketed alongside their products, ensuring compliance with the Regulation.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6c9021d6cb53dceeddd1e648d3e37fbc</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_25.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1747657107</data>
    </node>
    <node id="third party">
      <data key="d0">third party</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Third parties are entities that supply tools, services, components, or processes used in high-risk AI systems, and have specific obligations under the Regulation.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6c9021d6cb53dceeddd1e648d3e37fbc</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_25.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1747657107</data>
    </node>
    <node id="third parties">
      <data key="d0">third parties</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Third parties refer to external entities providing tools, services, processes, or components used in conjunction with high-risk AI systems.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7cc37264ee8f2a814b7b6f98953de48c</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_25.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1747657107</data>
    </node>
    <node id="AI System Provider">
      <data key="d0">AI System Provider</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">AI System Providers are companies or individuals that supply the necessary AI systems, tools, services, or components used in high-risk AI applications.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7cc37264ee8f2a814b7b6f98953de48c</data>
