    <node id="Council Directive 85/374/EEC">
      <data key="d0">Council Directive 85/374/EEC</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Council Directive 85/374/EEC establishes regulations concerning liability for defective products among EU Member States.&lt;SEP&gt;Council Directive 85/374/EEC is a European legislative act that addresses liability for defective products, aimed at harmonizing laws across Member States.&lt;SEP&gt;Council Directive 85/374/EEC provides a framework for liability related to defective products, which includes AI systems that could negatively impact consumers.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c28a81721b7de3ef4442495cc499b1cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-620a69f3197e8df8e7c863ebf2c2155c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a5ff05678672211287e9053ebcd9c1c6</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_9.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1747657131</data>
    </node>
    <node id="UNCRC General">
      <data key="d0">UNCRC General</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">The UNCRC General (United Nations Convention on the Rights of the Child) establishes rights for children, which are considered in the context of protecting minors in relation to AI systems.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c28a81721b7de3ef4442495cc499b1cb</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_9.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1747657131</data>
    </node>
    <node id="National Labour Law">
      <data key="d0">National Labour Law</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">National Labour Law encompasses various laws implemented in member states that govern employment rights, working conditions, and the protection of workers' rights.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c28a81721b7de3ef4442495cc499b1cb</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_9.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1747657131</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Platform Work Directive">
      <data key="d0">Platform Work Directive</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">The Platform Work Directive aims to improve working conditions specifically for individuals engaged in platform work, enhancing labor rights and protections.&lt;SEP&gt;The Platform Work Directive is aimed at improving working conditions in platform work, intersecting with rights related to AI systems.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c28a81721b7de3ef4442495cc499b1cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b474f9815c7033ca1ad8daff4012eff</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_9.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1747657131</data>
