      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Placing on the market refers to the act of making an AI system available for distribution or use in the market for the first time.&lt;SEP&gt;Placing on the market refers to the first making available of an AI system or general-purpose AI model for commercial distribution.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7dbd41da6ea2a77fff5beb18c8e7c896&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7d62750f1113d24ac155fcd2b2ef02c</data>
