      <data key="d0">Making Available on the Market</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Making available on the market encompasses the supply of AI systems for distribution, whether for payment or free of charge.&lt;SEP&gt;Making available on the market refers to supplying an AI system or model for distribution or use in commercial activity, whether paid or free.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7dbd41da6ea2a77fff5beb18c8e7c896&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7d62750f1113d24ac155fcd2b2ef02c</data>
