    <node id="Putting into Service">
      <data key="d0">Putting into Service</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Putting into service describes the act of supplying an AI system for first use either directly to the deployer or for their own intended purpose.&lt;SEP&gt;Putting into service refers to supplying an AI system for its first use directly to the deployer or for personal use.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7dbd41da6ea2a77fff5beb18c8e7c896&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7d62750f1113d24ac155fcd2b2ef02c</data>
