      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Safety Components are parts of an AI system that fulfill safety functions, crucial for ensuring the system does not endanger health or safety.&lt;SEP&gt;Safety components are elements of an AI system that fulfill safety functions, ensuring health and safety of individuals during operation.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7dbd41da6ea2a77fff5beb18c8e7c896&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f5fc2b531499a81e154196ee1e86ac6</data>
