      <data key="d0">AI System Performance</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">AI System Performance refers to how effectively an AI system operates, influenced by the quality of training data and the implementation of governance practices.&lt;SEP&gt;AI System Performance refers to the capability of an AI system to meet its designed objectives and operational requirements effectively.</data>
