      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">A harmonised standard is defined to ensure compliance with specific requirements as outlined in Regulation (EU) No 1025/2012.&lt;SEP&gt;Harmonised standards are technical specifications approved by recognized standardization organizations, providing a presumption of conformity with regulations for AI model providers.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0c8a6b92fbe8d93eb878957c5ed60aa0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-43e82a7af456b2ae813a7217f92c2008</data>
