      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The European AI Office is responsible for overseeing AI regulations, including development of compliance templates and guidelines.&lt;SEP&gt;The European Artificial Intelligence Office is responsible for overseeing the deployment of AI technologies, facilitating compliance, and reducing administrative burdens.&lt;SEP&gt;The European Artificial Intelligence Office is established as a regulatory body to oversee and facilitate artificial intelligence initiatives across Europe.&lt;SEP&gt;The European Artificial Intelligence Office was established by Commission Decision to develop Union expertise and capabilities in the field of AI and contribute to the implementation of Union law on AI.</data>
