    <node id="Annex VII">
      <data key="d0">Annex VII</data>
      <data key="d1">document</data>
      <data key="d2">Annex VII details conformity assessment procedures involving notified bodies for high-risk AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Annex VII outlines the conformity assessment procedures for high-risk AI systems and the involvement of notified bodies.&lt;SEP&gt;Annex VII outlines the conformity assessment procedures that high-risk AI systems must undergo, particularly following modifications.&lt;SEP&gt;Annex VII refers to a section of regulatory text concerning certificates issued by notified bodies for AI systems, focusing on the language requirements for validity.&lt;SEP&gt;Annex VII specifies requirements and guidelines for the amendment of related articles affecting AI systems.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-41e5d20a8e9427a4698b84f758676994&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-69838403e8b59bb122436a0d25a9fc1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-397d6e2474c4f45e883f265653f2e715&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c4d62babb1c5a144faeae6ac2f13628&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c72b31b17ef0accd3df4ab25a063163</data>
