    <node id="Certificates">
      <data key="d0">Certificates</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Certificates are formal documents issued by notified bodies to affirm that certain products or services meet defined regulatory standards or requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;Certificates are official documents issued by a Notified Body confirming that a high-risk AI system meets the necessary safety and compliance requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;Certificates are official documents issued by notified bodies to confirm that an AI system meets regulatory requirements.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8caee37338a6383c30fe06ea2b3e4761&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-397d6e2474c4f45e883f265653f2e715&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-595952fa3e7e47cb312adaaad303b73c</data>
