      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Regulation (EC) No 300/2008 establishes common rules for civil aviation security in the EU, affecting the regulation of high-risk systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Regulation (EC) No 300/2008 is a regulation concerning common rules in civil aviation security.&lt;SEP&gt;Regulation (EC) No 300/2008 is a European legislative document that sets rules concerning the approval and use of security equipment.&lt;SEP&gt;Regulation (EC) No 300/2008 is a European regulation concerning the establishment of a high level of civil aviation security in the European Union.</data>
