      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Distributors are operators within the AI systems value chain who may also have specific obligations related to compliance with regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Distributors are responsible for making high-risk AI systems available on the market and ensuring they meet compliance standards.&lt;SEP&gt;Distributors play a role in the supply chain of high-risk AI systems by communicating changes or non-compliance issues to relevant parties.</data>
