      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Article 90(1) outlines the process for the Commission to designate general-purpose AI models that present systemic risks based on alerts from the scientific panel.&lt;SEP&gt;Article 90(1) refers to the legal framework under which the scientific panel alerts The Commission regarding systemic risks posed by AI models.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c1ef1c9ca92c002cf6ad36264fe1292c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e23bb4c71b510fec0bbe6570de37cd5</data>
