      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Confidential business information encompasses trade secrets and proprietary data that companies must protect to maintain a competitive edge and comply with regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Confidential business information refers to sensitive data that a business wants to keep private to protect its competitive advantage and maintain strategic business operations.</data>
