    <edge source="Union Harmonisation Legislation" target="High-Risk AI Systems">
      <data key="d6">44.0</data>
      <data key="d7">High-Risk AI Systems are governed by the Union Harmonisation Legislation, ensuring they meet specific safety and performance standards.&lt;SEP&gt;High-Risk AI Systems are subject to specific requirements that fall under the scope of Union Harmonisation Legislation to ensure compliance.&lt;SEP&gt;High-Risk AI Systems must meet the conformity assessment requirements set out in the Union Harmonisation Legislation for authorisation.&lt;SEP&gt;The Union harmonisation legislation provides the regulatory framework applicable to high-risk AI systems, ensuring they meet necessary safety requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;Union harmonisation legislation serves as a foundational legal framework that specifies safety norms for the deployment of high-risk AI systems.</data>
