    <edge source="AI System" target="Union Law">
      <data key="d6">35.0</data>
      <data key="d7">AI systems must adhere to Union law to ensure they do not pose significant risks to rights and safety.&lt;SEP&gt;The classification of AI systems as high-risk is governed by Union law, which stipulates the legal frameworks and compliance requirements for AI use.&lt;SEP&gt;Union Law provides a regulatory framework that addresses the risks associated with AI systems, particularly concerning fundamental rights and safety.&lt;SEP&gt;The AI System's testing and liability are governed by Union Law, which outlines responsibilities and legal frameworks.</data>
      <data key="d8">compliance,legal framework,legal standards,regulation,risk management</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-50beca99a2207706ee9f0ad17a4205ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a350089bbf860c041d514aa2041d9455&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb0291da832d9defa94aaf2262ad3761&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1eea61d03ab615ac5f518e77cd220c1d</data>
      <data key="d10">./cached_docs/recital_63.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_7.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_60.json</data>
      <data key="d11">1747657584</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="AI System" target="Charter">
      <data key="d6">25.0</data>
      <data key="d7">AI systems must be evaluated against the fundamental rights stated in the Charter to assess their impact.&lt;SEP&gt;The use of high-risk AI systems must align with the principles established in the Charter concerning personal data protection.&lt;SEP&gt;The operations of AI systems must align with the rights outlined in the Charter, including freedom of expression.</data>
      <data key="d8">AI impact,data protection,ethical considerations,legal framework,rights assessment,rights protection</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-0e284955c1d36330bd14d117bb417611&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1eea61d03ab615ac5f518e77cd220c1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4acea71d2f59038573b7ec13db4ad10b</data>
      <data key="d10">./cached_docs/recital_63.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_48.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_134.json</data>
      <data key="d11">1747464278</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="AI System" target="Regulation">
      <data key="d6">62.0</data>
      <data key="d7">AI systems must adhere to comprehensive regulations when utilized for civilian or law enforcement purposes, particularly when they also have applications in military or national security contexts. The Regulation establishes a legal framework that governs the use and deployment of AI systems by various deployers. It specifically classifies AI systems as high-risk and outlines the compliance requirements necessary for their deployment, ensuring that they meet rigorous safety standards. Additionally, the Regulation stipulates guidelines for the design, testing, and deployment of AI systems, particularly concerning their role in generating or manipulating content, which serves to protect authenticity and uphold rights.&lt;SEP&gt;The classification of AI systems involves regulations that dictate safety and performance criteria for AI products."&lt;&lt;"regulatory framework, compliance</data>
      <data key="d8">9,compliance,governance,legal framework,regulation,regulatory oversight,safety oversight</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-4acea71d2f59038573b7ec13db4ad10b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ffa7662f1a996e8ed97ec3caf0ae564&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c9405f93ec3e0ccf6209ed15ef0263f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8efd21db4fc63a879493cbb376ae904&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b28a4b325cc05a6cc4897f58ccdf00f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be61089eed18cfaf2703713378c589a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1eea61d03ab615ac5f518e77cd220c1d</data>
      <data key="d10">./cached_docs/recital_13.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_134.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_3.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_24.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_86.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_63.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_51.json</data>
      <data key="d11">1747658080</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="AI System" target="Personal Data">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">AI Systems that process Personal Data must comply with the relevant aspects of the Regulation to ensure lawful handling of such data.</data>
      <data key="d8">data compliance, AI ethics</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-1eea61d03ab615ac5f518e77cd220c1d</data>
      <data key="d10">./cached_docs/recital_63.json</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="AI System" target="Deployer">
      <data key="d6">23.0</data>
      <data key="d7">A deployer uses an AI system under their authority, making them integral to the system's operation.&lt;SEP&gt;The deployer is directly responsible for employing an AI system under its authority as stated in the Regulation.&lt;SEP&gt;The deployer must take into account the risks associated with the AI system when utilizing it according to its intended purpose.</data>
      <data key="d8">operational command,operational safety,responsibility,usage,user awareness</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-2b28a4b325cc05a6cc4897f58ccdf00f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b5e606b14946a1b388f008868e8e155&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7d62750f1113d24ac155fcd2b2ef02c</data>
      <data key="d10">./cached_docs/article_3.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_65.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_13.json</data>
      <data key="d11">1747657226</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="AI System" target="Public Authority">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Public authorities deploy AI systems to serve public interests and fulfill governmental duties.</data>
      <data key="d8">governmental function, technological application</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-2b28a4b325cc05a6cc4897f58ccdf00f</data>
      <data key="d10">./cached_docs/recital_13.json</data>
    </edge>
