    <edge source="AI System" target="Market Surveillance Authority">
      <data key="d6">17.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Market surveillance authorities monitor and take action regarding non-compliance of AI systems in the market.&lt;SEP&gt;The Market Surveillance Authority evaluates AI systems for compliance with safety regulations as outlined in the Articles.".</data>
