    </edge>
    <edge source="AI System" target="Subjects of Testing">
      <data key="d6">6.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The AI system may make decisions regarding the involvement of subjects of testing in real world conditions, affecting their participation.</data>
      <data key="d8">decision-making, ethical responsibility</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-ba5a4fee300868ea16940c9ea15f534a</data>
      <data key="d10">./cached_docs/article_61.json</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="AI System" target="Regulation (EU) 2016/679">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The AI system's operation and compliance are governed by the principles outlined in Regulation (EU) 2016/679, particularly regarding risks associated with data handling.</data>
      <data key="d8">regulatory compliance, data protection</data>
