    </edge>
    <edge source="Market Surveillance Authority" target="Regulation (EU) 2019/1020">
      <data key="d6">27.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Market Surveillance Authorities are designated under Regulation (EU) 2019/1020 to ensure compliance with its requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;The Market Surveillance Authority is tasked with evaluating AI systems under the stipulations of Regulation (EU) 2019/1020 to ensure compliance and address risks.&lt;SEP&gt;The regulation outlines the responsibilities of the market surveillance authorities in enforcing compliance for AI systems.</data>
      <data key="d8">enforcement,oversight,regulatory compliance,regulatory framework</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-28daf57045ce50f0bd160cddd41ffc14&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9cb2802f1b508b813d06e58ae27a1f77&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53fb2685a38836a165fa7637bbbadce2</data>
      <data key="d10">./cached_docs/article_79.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_74.json</data>
      <data key="d11">1747464230</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Market Surveillance Authority" target="High-Risk AI Systems">
      <data key="d6">57.0</data>
      <data key="d7">High-Risk AI Systems are subject to oversight and regulation by Market Surveillance Authorities to ensure compliance with safety standards and legal regulations. These authorities are responsible for authorizing the market placement of High-Risk AI Systems under specific conditions, ensuring that they meet the necessary safety and compliance criteria. Operating within the EU legislative framework, the Market Surveillance Authority monitors and tests High-Risk AI Systems to verify their adherence to Union law. This regulatory entity plays a crucial role in assessing the compliance of these systems, particularly those utilized in law enforcement contexts, ensuring that they operate safely and meet established standards.</data>
      <data key="d8">AI compliance,AI regulation,authorization,compliance oversight,monitoring,oversight,regulatory authority,regulatory oversight,safety compliance,testing</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-e07ee6b3452d764ccd9733dceadb1ac7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8da189e7622be67a80b2e12945a657cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-69838403e8b59bb122436a0d25a9fc1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-13bd6c41d609ae7976a7b3ac4ab8e3fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6e853663a3f2d06a9cfea8582e10f089&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53fb2685a38836a165fa7637bbbadce2</data>
