    <edge source="Market Surveillance Authority" target="Chapter III, Section 2">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The evaluations conducted by the Market Surveillance Authority are guided by the requirements stated in Chapter III, Section 2.</data>
