    <edge source="Member State" target="Notified Body">
      <data key="d6">24.0</data>
      <data key="d7">A notified body operates within a Member State, adhering to national regulations for AI system certifications.&lt;SEP&gt;Notified Bodies are established under the national law of a Member State and must operate within that legal framework.&lt;SEP&gt;The Member State is responsible for taking corrective measures regarding the notified body if it fails to meet requirements.</data>
      <data key="d8">compliance,compliance measures,establishment,legal framework,regulatory context,regulatory responsibility</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-97182f6b8815d40f51faf3e8eaeb7c7d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb8e27222ad9e21f792d1e7ee0a1e255&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-397d6e2474c4f45e883f265653f2e715</data>
      <data key="d10">./cached_docs/article_37.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_44.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_31.json</data>
      <data key="d11">1747657285</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Member State" target="Notified Bodies">
      <data key="d6">17.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Member States are responsible for the actions of notified bodies and assume liability for conformity assessment activities according to national laws.&lt;SEP&gt;Notified bodies operate within the framework established by the Member States to ensure compliance with regulations affecting conformity assessments.</data>
      <data key="d8">regulatory compliance, organizational governance&lt;SEP&gt;regulatory responsibility, compliance</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-be2e0f993ca9c4e593e5fcbdd8fc03fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28717558f1bb8bd2fd8b9542f8e2a99c</data>
      <data key="d10">./cached_docs/article_31.json</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Member State" target="Commission">
      <data key="d6">64.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Commission oversees the actions of Member States to ensure they align with broader regulatory policies.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission plays a pivotal role in its regulatory relationship with Member States, actively consulting them for expertise prior to the adoption of delegated acts. As part of its oversight responsibilities, the Commission requires that Member States notify it of their national laws related to biometric identification systems used for law enforcement purposes. Furthermore, the Commission communicates and collaborates with Member States about their artificial intelligence (AI) practices to ensure adherence to Union law. It oversees the compliance of Member States with EU regulations, having the authority to mandate actions concerning national measures if necessary. Additionally, the Commission informs Member States about any compliance issues related to notified bodies and requests corrective actions to address such concerns. Lastly, decisions regarding authorizations are communicated to the respective Member States, reinforcing the structured regulatory framework between the Commission and Member States.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission requires Member States to notify it of their national rules regarding the Regulation within a specified timeframe.</data>
      <data key="d8">collaboration,compliance,compliance enforcement,consultation process,enforcement,expertise input,governance,legislation,notification obligation,regulatory authority,regulatory compliance,regulatory governance,regulatory oversight</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-27c28ab4482e4bec149657c656192c46&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b341fa074527a308a2434a3c68244d02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-13bd6c41d609ae7976a7b3ac4ab8e3fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8cc9a7191827dda78eda5924876e5f7e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-97182f6b8815d40f51faf3e8eaeb7c7d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ee6d94a5f64203f09d02387acbdb39c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67ecee9ae9852fb675f5c9c9cb2f2de6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da5fbf959baa6ee8e86278864a9144cc</data>
      <data key="d10">./cached_docs/article_36.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_46.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_5.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_37.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_97.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_81.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_37.json</data>
      <data key="d11">1747657339</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Member State" target="Union">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Union sets the legal framework within which Member States must operate, including rules about administrative fines.</data>
      <data key="d8">legal framework, governance</data>
