      <data key="d6">14.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Regulation must be interpreted alongside National Law, ensuring compatibility and compliance across jurisdictions regarding AI and personal data issues.&lt;SEP&gt;The Regulation serves as a guide for Member States in creating their National Laws regarding the authorization of certain uses.</data>
