      <data key="d6">16.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Regulations guide the deployer in making decisions using high-risk AI systems while ensuring the rights of affected individuals are upheld.&lt;SEP&gt;The Regulation outlines who qualifies as a deployer and their associated responsibilities regarding AI systems.</data>
