    <edge source="Regulation" target="AI Office">
      <data key="d6">62.0</data>
      <data key="d7">"The AI Office is tasked with monitoring compliance related to the Regulation that governs AI model obligations.";&lt;SEP&gt;The AI Office operates within the framework established by the Regulation, which governs its various functions and responsibilities. It is primarily responsible for developing actions and templates that align with the requirements of the Regulation, underscoring its critical role in the implementation process. The activities of the AI Office are vital for the enforcement of the Regulation, particularly concerning general-purpose AI models, and it is specifically tasked with ensuring governance and compliance in this context. Additionally, the AI Office oversees the implementation and adherence of the Regulation as it pertains to AI model providers, playing a crucial role in formulating recommendations that aid in fulfilling the obligations specified in the Regulation for high-risk AI systems.</data>
      <data key="d8">compliance,compliance monitoring,governance,monitoring compliance,operational guidelines,oversight,regulation enforcement,regulatory framework,regulatory oversight,regulatory responsibility</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-32556db3a80f72f1db354810bba21be7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6579442a2f027e643cf907006333003a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-18d33fd192f06f727ac6bb21becbaa57&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e3d60cf6cbe0ae91a9793cb5c98a4a92&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40a9e2a0fc4601f4b3d4f583384b6a06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7cc37264ee8f2a814b7b6f98953de48c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f892644f7a3eab6b024d8a386777f23</data>
      <data key="d10">./cached_docs/recital_108.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_64.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_151.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_89.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_62.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_179.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_25.json</data>
      <data key="d11">1747657430</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Regulation" target="Member States">
      <data key="d6">88.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Member States are obligated to implement and enforce the Regulation concerning AI systems, which significantly influences their national policies and market practices. They are responsible for adhering to the Regulation's provisions and must enforce its stipulations through established penalties. To ensure effective enforcement, Member States are encouraged to seek support from independent experts and develop rules that align with the Regulation. This includes creating and enforcing rules that pertain to national competent authorities and their roles in AI and data protection. 

The Regulation establishes a common framework that aims to promote the adoption of trustworthy AI while protecting individual rights. Consequently, it imposes certain compliance initiatives for providers and operators, affecting how Member States implement their national laws. Member States are specifically tasked with ensuring the compliance of high-risk AI systems in the market, necessitating a structured approach to enforcement and organizational roles related to the application of the Regulation's requirements.</data>
      <data key="d8">collective action,compliance,compliance oversight,enforcement,expert assistance,governance,implementation,legal obligation,oversight,regulatory compliance,regulatory enforcement,regulatory framework,regulatory impact,regulatory role</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-d42aaf56c15be020feabced14d2409d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-43942ba7283893ebf128acb858a20c58&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b43f399350f0fc36795c0ce358459d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0455405f9e173535e78c4ea589745cf4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5ea6a588c10ad2fe493ec8cc1913f72d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6579442a2f027e643cf907006333003a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7365f713d09e74d49090cb78cb3e19b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1dbe8a4749b15b91fcb1062fee4fa778&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-712b56cbfc73c46eacde9204fa4e5c49&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c2f867de2be6cb439557f91700b051c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40a9e2a0fc4601f4b3d4f583384b6a06</data>
