    <edge source="Regulation" target="High-Risk AI Systems">
      <data key="d6">79.0</data>
      <data key="d7">High-Risk AI Systems are subject to specific regulations that are designed to ensure their safety, effectiveness, and compliance throughout their lifecycle. These regulations mandate adherence to established standards which govern their development, monitoring, and deployment. The Regulation explicitly addresses High-Risk AI Systems, enforcing additional safeguards and measures to manage their use and mitigate potential risks. By ensuring that these systems function within defined legal and safety boundaries, the Regulation plays a crucial role in overseeing the implications and applications of High-Risk AI Systems.&lt;SEP&gt;The Regulation specifically addresses compliance requirements for products with high-risk AI systems, guiding providers on necessary actions.&lt;SEP&gt;The Regulation specifically addresses the compliance requirements for managing high-risk AI systems.".&lt;SEP&gt;High-risk AI systems must comply with specific regulations to bear the CE marking, indicating their adherence to safety and quality standards.</data>
      <data key="d8">AI governance,AI systems,compliance,governance,legislative focus,legislative requirements,regulation,regulations,regulatory compliance,regulatory framework,regulatory governance,regulatory requirements,risk management,safety oversight,safety standards</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-43942ba7283893ebf128acb858a20c58&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8e23760d52ebfb589b4de63afe8ab83&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa2298fd83910d35175065de74977bd4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b8c1122e1044e4445aa96d7fa6d5b6e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c168b1207668ad4ba646371f91bfce09&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ac68c725e087cb7c659f2dd75f0a6e34&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2315cd7abb88dee440f081de5430a32f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b754e2170dea6f93253ec4fd1fa88d5</data>
