    <edge source="Union" target="AI Office">
      <data key="d6">63.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The AI Office adheres to regulations set by the Union regarding the deployment and transparency of AI content generation.&lt;SEP&gt;The AI Office operates under the authority and legal framework established by the Union, focusing on the oversight and regulation of AI systems across member states. Its primary aim is to standardize practices regarding AI systems, ensuring compliance with relevant legislation. The AI Office is responsible for enforcing AI-related regulations and provides oversight on the implementation of codes of practice. Additionally, the Union oversees the actions of the AI Office, ensuring that its operations align with the broader regulatory goals set forth by the Union. Overall, the AI Office plays a crucial role in the regulatory landscape of AI within the Union, striving to maintain coherent and effective practices among all member states.</data>
      <data key="d8">compliance,cross-border governance,governance,government oversight,organizational hierarchy,oversight,regulatory authority,regulatory body,regulatory compliance,regulatory framework,regulatory oversight</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-873c3732f26f3ace86c77cfec67991ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f6de18717bcb0167956be85a15dd210f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b567607dbb431b0d294cd02679760039&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50cb89ed7d0d818018d373ebefa65267&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-daa2a9a43bd7a2482ad876b406b9e9c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e3d60cf6cbe0ae91a9793cb5c98a4a92&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b90abf0636c26d546e9b6724e3224ae</data>
      <data key="d10">./cached_docs/article_56.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_54.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_161.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_50.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_62.json</data>
      <data key="d11">1747464583</data>
    </edge>
