    <edge source="Union" target="AI Systems Regulation">
      <data key="d6">19.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The AI Systems Regulation is applicable to providers and deployers of AI systems within the Union, outlining legal obligations.&lt;SEP&gt;The AI Systems Regulation is enacted by the Union to ensure proper governance and compliance of AI systems across member states.</data>
