    <edge source="Union" target="High-Risk AI Systems">
      <data key="d6">17.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Union establishes rules and guidelines for high-risk AI systems to ensure public safety and adherence to ethical principles.&lt;SEP&gt;The Union is involved in the regulation and governance of high-risk AI systems, particularly regarding their application in law enforcement and migration.</data>
      <data key="d8">regulation, governance&lt;SEP&gt;regulation, public safety</data>
