    </edge>
    <edge source="Union" target="Natural Persons">
      <data key="d6">26.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Union has legal frameworks that govern how natural persons are treated and assessed in criminal matters.&lt;SEP&gt;Union supports the requirement for identification verification by natural persons with necessary competence in managing high-risk AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;The Union's regulations are designed to protect the rights and freedoms of natural persons.</data>
