    <edge source="Union" target="Commission">
      <data key="d6">43.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Commission operates as a governing body within the broader context of the Union and its Member States.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission operates under the Union's mandate to develop expertise in AI, reflecting its strategic objectives.&lt;SEP&gt;The Union empowers the Commission to propose and enforce regulations that affect member states and their compliance efforts.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission operates within the framework of the Union to ensure regulations are enforced and codes of practice are established for AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission operates within the Union's framework to enforce regulations on AI model providers.</data>
