    <edge source="AI Systems" target="Natural Persons">
      <data key="d6">80.0</data>
      <data key="d7">"Natural persons may be identified by AI systems in public spaces, affecting their privacy and freedom due to surveillance implications.")&lt;SEP&gt;AI Systems have a significant impact on Natural Persons across various domains, raising a multitude of ethical concerns regarding fairness, privacy, and rights. These systems evaluate Natural Persons in several contexts, such as social scoring and creditworthiness, which can lead to unfair treatment and affect access to essential resources like financial services and benefits. 

Moreover, AI Systems are utilized to analyze the behaviors and characteristics of Natural Persons and to identify their emotions. This capability raises critical ethical questions about data usage and privacy, as well as the potential for misuse in sensitive areas such as migration and asylum processes. The interaction between AI Systems and Natural Persons necessitates a commitment to transparency and adherence to ethical standards to safeguard the rights and protections of individuals. 

Overall, while AI Systems have the potential to enhance various processes involving Natural Persons, their deployment must be carefully managed to address the implications of social scoring and the impacts on individual rights and opportunities.&lt;SEP&gt;AI Systems must ensure transparency when interacting with Natural Persons to avoid impersonation or deception.</data>
      <data key="d8">access to resources,data privacy,decision-making,discrimination,ethical implications,ethical standards,evaluation,impact,impact on individuals,impact on rights,individual rights,interaction,privacy concerns,profiling,social behavior,transparency obligation,user interaction,vulnerability</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-28efea7f8fe5945cce5b7be57e88efe7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b31c82fb046f107cbfab945a92431bbc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d44e4d07784e334a8ded2c1da49b969e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab148daacc5693b15ec462635a5502a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8dead6db59d178a53a4fc03ed67a92e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83317eda1161cf5d13ef9aa07297c98b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-431ae031d4ead528e84df75526b0f1dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2bccefc944ad0794c75bc69b977c88a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb43ec5a01dc502046ab6ffbe3a25504</data>
      <data key="d10">./cached_docs/recital_60.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_132.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_5.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_44.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_50.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_31.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_58.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_32.json</data>
      <data key="d11">1747657468</data>
    </edge>
