    <edge source="AI Systems" target="Law Enforcement">
      <data key="d6">38.0</data>
      <data key="d7">"AI systems are employed by law enforcement for biometric identification, which raises ethical and rights concerns for individuals.")&lt;SEP&gt;AI Systems can be used by Law Enforcement for real-time biometric identification to enhance public safety.&lt;SEP&gt;Law Enforcement may deploy AI Systems for the identification of suspects in criminal investigations, indicating a strong interdependence of technology and legal practices.&lt;SEP&gt;Law enforcement utilizes AI systems to enhance public safety, separate from military applications.&lt;SEP&gt;Certain AI Systems may have targeted exceptions for use by Law Enforcement agencies, acknowledging their special needs.</data>
      <data key="d8">exceptional use,law enforcement,public safety,surveillance,technological application,technology usage</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-1be166c61f466e23c3d8c143f6efd3bb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab148daacc5693b15ec462635a5502a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ee1f186f5aed070bc8e6e813caed9967&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5981afe4b9fb547c64f49e76b1d9c0a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb43ec5a01dc502046ab6ffbe3a25504</data>
      <data key="d10">./cached_docs/recital_132.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_5.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_24.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_38.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_32.json</data>
      <data key="d11">1747657468</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="AI Systems" target="Biometric Categorisation Systems">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">AI Systems often include Biometric Categorisation Systems as a subset used to analyze and classify individuals based on their biometric data.</data>
      <data key="d8">sub-category, technology integration</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-1be166c61f466e23c3d8c143f6efd3bb</data>
      <data key="d10">./cached_docs/article_5.json</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="AI Systems" target="Human Rights">
      <data key="d6">18.0</data>
      <data key="d7">AI Systems must operate in a manner that respects and upholds Human Rights to prevent violations and discrimination.&lt;SEP&gt;The use of AI Systems has implications for Human Rights, particularly in areas like privacy and discrimination when assessing individuals based on biometric data.</data>
      <data key="d8">human rights compliance, ethical technology&lt;SEP&gt;social impact, privacy</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-1be166c61f466e23c3d8c143f6efd3bb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-849f8f0403e6b12fa8a9c24b84c094c7</data>
      <data key="d10">./cached_docs/recital_27.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_5.json</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="AI Systems" target="Emotional Inference">
      <data key="d6">10.0</data>
      <data key="d7">AI Systems leverage Emotional Inference to assess human emotions based on biometric data, showing the interconnectedness of technology and psychology.</data>
      <data key="d8">technology usage, emotion analysis</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-1be166c61f466e23c3d8c143f6efd3bb</data>
      <data key="d10">./cached_docs/article_5.json</data>
    </edge>
