    <edge source="AI Systems" target="Conformity Assessment Procedure">
      <data key="d6">17.0</data>
      <data key="d7">AI Systems need to undergo the Conformity Assessment Procedure to ensure they are compliant with regulatory standards before deployment.&lt;SEP&gt;AI systems need to undergo the conformity assessment procedure to demonstrate compliance with safety standards mandated by legislation.</data>
      <data key="d8">assessment,compliance process,regulatory compliance,risk assessment</data>
