    <edge source="AI Systems" target="Safety Components">
      <data key="d6">16.0</data>
      <data key="d7">AI systems are categorized as safety components intended to manage risks in critical infrastructure and ensure operational integrity.&lt;SEP&gt;AI systems can serve as safety components in products, enhancing the reliability and safety of those products.</data>
