    <edge source="AI Systems" target="The Commission">
      <data key="d6">17.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Commission has the authority to regulate AI systems intended for use in sensitive areas, ensuring they meet safety and rights standards.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission regulates AI systems, particularly focusing on high-risk categories that require specific assessments and compliance checks.</data>
      <data key="d8">compliance,oversight,regulation,regulatory authority</data>
