    </edge>
    <edge source="AI Systems" target="Health and Safety">
      <data key="d6">25.0</data>
      <data key="d7">AI Systems potentially contribute to improving Health and Safety standards through rapid availability and innovative solutions in emergencies.&lt;SEP&gt;AI systems are evaluated based on their potential risks to health and safety, necessitating careful regulation.&lt;SEP&gt;Health and Safety regulations are necessary to ensure that AI Systems do not adversely affect individuals' well-being.</data>
      <data key="d8">ethical usage,health innovation,risk management,safety,safety standards,safety technology</data>
