    <edge source="AI Systems" target="Member States">
      <data key="d6">22.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Member States are exploring national rules related to the adoption of AI systems to ensure their trustworthy use.&lt;SEP&gt;Member States are responsible for regulating the use of AI systems in military and national security contexts, ensuring compliance with international laws.&lt;SEP&gt;Member States have the authority to implement their own regulations on AI systems, impacting how these technologies are utilized in the workforce.</data>
      <data key="d8">national rules,regulation,regulatory authority,regulatory exploration,responsibility,workforce impact</data>
