    <edge source="AI Systems" target="Diversity, Non-Discrimination and Fairness">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">AI Systems should embody Diversity, Non-Discrimination, and Fairness to prevent bias and ensure equitable access for all users.</data>
