    <edge source="AI Systems" target="Persons with Disabilities">
      <data key="d6">18.0</data>
      <data key="d7">AI systems in the workplace can contribute to discriminatory practices that adversely affect persons with disabilities.&lt;SEP&gt;AI systems must be designed with considerations for accessibility to ensure they serve the needs of persons with disabilities.</data>
