    <edge source="Provider" target="General-Purpose AI Model">
      <data key="d6">41.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Providers submit their AI models for assessment and may be affected by the designation of systemic risks related to their models.&lt;SEP&gt;The Provider is associated with the development and implementation of the General-Purpose AI Model, which has been designated as having systemic risk.&lt;SEP&gt;The provider is responsible for developing general-purpose AI models and ensuring they meet regulatory standards before market entry.&lt;SEP&gt;The provider is responsible for delivering information to the Commission when a general-purpose AI model requires evaluation for systemic risks.&lt;SEP&gt;The Provider offers the General-Purpose AI Model, ensuring its availability for various applications and purposes.</data>
