      <data key="d6">35.0</data>
      <data key="d7">High-risk AI systems are defined and managed under the framework set by Union law to minimize risks to rights and safety.&lt;SEP&gt;High-risk AI systems are regulated under Union law which dictates the rights of affected individuals to explanations about decisions made using these systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Union law affects the operations of high-risk AI systems by setting legal standards for the processing of personal data and protecting rights.&lt;SEP&gt;High-risk AI systems fall under the purview of Union law, which mandates specific regulations to ensure they are used appropriately and ethically in law enforcement.</data>
