      <data key="d7">The Commission enforces Regulation (EU) 2019/1020 and oversees related compliance activities by market surveillance authorities.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission establishes and implements Regulation (EU) 2019/1020 to facilitate effective market surveillance.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission is responsible for implementing and developing guidance related to the obligations set forth in Regulation (EU) 2019/1020.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission enforces Regulation (EU) 2019/1020, ensuring that market surveillance is conducted effectively in the EU.</data>
