    <edge source="Commission" target="Market Surveillance Authorities">
      <data key="d6">45.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Market Surveillance Authorities collaborate with the Commission to ensure adherence to AI regulations and enforce compliance.&lt;SEP&gt;Market Surveillance Authorities must notify the Commission about measures taken with non-compliant AI systems, establishing a mandatory communication link.&lt;SEP&gt;Market Surveillance Authorities work in coordination with the Commission for joint investigations and compliance activities.&lt;SEP&gt;Market surveillance authorities may request the Commission to exercise its powers to assist in regulatory compliance.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission provides support to Market Surveillance Authorities in relation to the EU Database functionality and data accessibility.</data>
