    <edge source="Commission" target="Court of Justice of the European Union">
      <data key="d6">34.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Commission's activities are subject to oversight by the Court of Justice, ensuring actions are legally compliant.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission's decisions on fines are subject to review by the Court of Justice of the European Union, indicating a legal oversight relationship.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission's decisions on fines can be reviewed by the Court of Justice of the European Union, which has the authority to alter those decisions.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission's decisions can be reviewed by the Court of Justice of the European Union, indicating a regulatory relationship between the two organizations.</data>
