    <edge source="Commission" target="General-Purpose AI Models">
      <data key="d6">27.0</data>
      <data key="d7">"The Commission enforces regulations that apply specifically to general-purpose AI models.";&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission is responsible for making regulatory decisions regarding the classification of general-purpose AI models based on their risks.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission is responsible for overseeing the implementation of regulations governing General-Purpose AI Models across Member States.</data>
