      <data key="d11">1747464205</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Commission" target="General-Purpose AI Model">
      <data key="d6">52.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Commission is tasked with the assessment and designation of general-purpose AI models, focusing on their capabilities and the potential systemic risks they may pose. It is responsible for evaluating these models to ascertain whether they meet the established criteria for high impact capabilities. In addition to this evaluation, the Commission is also responsible for potentially reassessing the systemic risks associated with general-purpose AI models. Furthermore, it regulates the use of these models to ensure they do not pose systemic risks at the Union level. Overall, the Commission plays a critical role in the oversight and regulation of general-purpose AI models, aiming to mitigate risks while promoting their capabilities.</data>
      <data key="d8">AI regulation,capability evaluation,evaluation,impact assessment,oversight,regulation,regulatory assessment,regulatory oversight,risk assessment</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-90efb8f063f236753e4794005afa2a0d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e23bb4c71b510fec0bbe6570de37cd5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fe0c14a128bfd78c4c5056f7102cc152&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a0bef2c1dcc3d7b428c7611732f7ffc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e519b84a1d0987cd3b0aab32a476aa33</data>
