    <edge source="Commission" target="National Competent Authorities">
      <data key="d6">55.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Commission collaborates closely with national competent authorities to ensure the effective implementation and oversight of regulations related to artificial intelligence (AI). It delegates authority to these national bodies to oversee the local execution of AI regulatory sandboxes, which are controlled environments for testing AI technologies. National competent authorities are mandated to notify the Commission about third-party conformity assessments necessary for compliance with regulatory standards. Additionally, they are responsible for reporting serious incidents, their findings, and the status of their activities to the Commission, thereby facilitating thorough evaluation and recommendations. They also inform the Commission about their available resources and current compliance status, which aids in maintaining regulatory adherence across the EU. This partnership between the Commission and national competent authorities plays a crucial role in monitoring and enforcing AI safety regulations effectively.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission informs National Competent Authorities about certificates related to high-risk AI systems, influencing their monitoring responsibilities.</data>
      <data key="d8">compliance,enforcement,incident notification,information sharing,notification process,oversight,regulation,regulatory communication,regulatory delegation,regulatory framework,regulatory oversight,reporting</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-d42aaf56c15be020feabced14d2409d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aca56f82b70892874784bcec5c2bb2c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-97ee5867d3c03f24001b650ad752686d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-595952fa3e7e47cb312adaaad303b73c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b0c31436f0e7ce27ce5952aa2bf9ae5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22275ba6343521309923fef233affa2a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-447d51c65bac6d28fd62c36c3e70e08b</data>
      <data key="d10">./cached_docs/article_36.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_115.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_58.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_126.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_73.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_70.json</data>
      <data key="d11">1747657339</data>
    </edge>
