    <edge source="Commission" target="EUR 15 000 000">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The imposition of fines up to EUR 15 000 000 is a penalty the Commission can enforce for non-compliance with regulations.</data>
      <data key="d8">financial penalties, regulatory compliance</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-0b16c22014fb75795531a9a187b8fc81</data>
      <data key="d10">./cached_docs/article_101.json</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Commission" target="Fines">
      <data key="d6">17.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Fines imposed are determined by the Commission's decisions and require reporting and procedural safeguards as outlined in legal articles.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission has the authority to impose Fines on providers who violate the obligations established in the Regulation.</data>
      <data key="d8">regulatory authority, penalty enforcement&lt;SEP&gt;regulatory process, penalty enforcement</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-ae3ab8a3b5c5d0c61e8b99fa718913b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de6a0d59bb86cca6093fbb52cf156b4e</data>
      <data key="d10">./cached_docs/recital_169.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_101.json</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Commission" target="Board">
      <data key="d6">41.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Board and the Commission work together on the implementation and enforcement of the Regulation.&lt;SEP&gt;The Board receives information on fines from the Commission, reflecting a relationship of oversight and communication regarding regulatory actions.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission supports the Board in implementing AI regulations and facilitating cooperation between Member States.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission supports the activities of the Board in developing market surveillance sub-groups and studies.&lt;SEP&gt;The Board works in conjunction with the Commission to establish guidelines and best practices for compliance with the Regulation.</data>
      <data key="d8">collaboration,governance,guidance,oversight,regulatory guidance,regulatory oversight,regulatory support,support</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-d42aaf56c15be020feabced14d2409d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de6a0d59bb86cca6093fbb52cf156b4e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d4058e2567f154203a2d9dacec4bdf7c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f76666cf495bb0f0810313fe42e2c882&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aacbea1ddddc58fbf14c882b36d9a6b3</data>
