      <data key="d11">1747657281</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Commission" target="Article 98(2)">
      <data key="d6">23.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Article 98(2) dictates the examination procedures that the Commission must follow, reinforcing checks on AI regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission adopts implementing acts in accordance with procedures outlined in Article 98(2), establishing legal protocols for fine implementation.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission's actions regarding the suspension or withdrawal of notification are guided by the examination procedure outlined in Article 98(2).</data>
      <data key="d8">compliance,compliance action,legal procedures,regulatory framework,regulatory frameworks,regulatory procedure</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-de6a0d59bb86cca6093fbb52cf156b4e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff61ec794793cf787d4a0473487a06f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-97182f6b8815d40f51faf3e8eaeb7c7d</data>
