    <edge source="European Parliament" target="Council of the European Union">
      <data key="d6">101.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Council of the European Union and the European Parliament collaborate closely in the legislative process to create and amend regulations and directives that govern a wide range of issues within the European Union (EU). This partnership is particularly significant in the development of laws related to health and safety standards for products that incorporate artificial intelligence (AI) systems, as well as in areas like personal data protection, cybersecurity, and technology governance.

Together, these two institutions are instrumental in enacting significant regulations, such as the Digital Services Act, which reflects their collective efforts to address emerging technologies and their implications. Their cooperation ensures a cohesive approach to legislative matters, highlighting their critical roles in shaping and adopting EU directives and regulations.

In addition to their work on AI, the Council of the European Union and the European Parliament also focus on regulations related to vehicle safety and compliance, demonstrating the breadth of their collaborative endeavors in ensuring the safety and governance of various sectors within the EU framework. Overall, their joint efforts emphasize the importance of both institutions in the governance of the European Union and the regulation of key areas affecting its member states.</data>
      <data key="d8">EU governance,EU institutions,collaboration,governance,institutional collaboration,legislative authority,legislative collaboration,legislative cooperation</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-7eb5283f4e280f1ec77650d624699286&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41d5cbcbecdcfde489e01bbfe08dc447&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04f1483cdf6b84729e33ebc4a611375b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6485ea34e7fea16b2f5a59242c8ef2a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-feb00b9eef4af47cdd3264cd99d6b2e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-74def3a33d9c60f3c11227adf7704a09&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-60a12c037b4dee54159c11f348ff3f11&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be3ac2351d8798fda8093d05f96f97fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-85605aee8aaac2bf4ad29d80d902148f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e0b46b9cdd1723562953df9638581250&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cdc616126c9eed60b2893f6f0c5a24b1</data>
