    <edge source="Regulation (EU) 2024/1689" target="Artificial Intelligence Act">
      <data key="d6">54.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Regulation (EU) 2024/1689 serves as the foundational regulatory framework that defines and governs the principles of the Artificial Intelligence Act within the European Union. It can be viewed as a major component of the broader Artificial Intelligence Act, which comprises various rules pertaining to AI technologies. This regulation establishes the legal framework for the development and deployment of AI systems, outlining specific rules that are integral to ensuring the effective governance of artificial intelligence. Overall, Regulation (EU) 2024/1689 is closely tied to the framework set by the Artificial Intelligence Act, signifying its importance in the legal landscape surrounding AI in the EU.</data>
      <data key="d8">AI governance,AI legislation,legal governance,legal impact,legislation,normative framework,regulatory focus,regulatory framework</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-6485ea34e7fea16b2f5a59242c8ef2a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a4219a2a10d85ddd82f98b8d6267cb9b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c472ba24566e25512f738275d98a9e3b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e0b46b9cdd1723562953df9638581250&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a5a3ae528d10c9d38e017d520ab6719</data>
