      <data key="d6">30.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Regulation (EU) 2024/1689 also updates Regulation (EU) No 167/2013 in the context of agricultural vehicle compliance with AI standards.&lt;SEP&gt;Regulation (EU) 2024/1689 ensures that AI systems used in agricultural vehicles comply with EU safety standards set by Regulation (EU) No 167/2013.&lt;SEP&gt;Regulation (EU) 2024/1689 modifies and expands upon the stipulations of Regulation (EU) No 167/2013 to enhance regulatory frameworks surrounding artificial intelligence.".&lt;SEP&gt;Regulation (EU) No 167/2013 is amended by Regulation (EU) 2024/1689, which impacts rules on artificial intelligence systems.".</data>
