    <edge source="Regulation (EU) 2024/1689" target="Council of the European Union">
      <data key="d6">61.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Council of the European Union played a pivotal role in the establishment and adoption of Regulation (EU) 2024/1689, which focuses on the regulation of artificial intelligence. This regulation was developed in collaboration with the European Parliament, with both entities participating actively in the legislative process to ensure its approval. The Council's involvement was crucial in facilitating the adoption of these rules concerning artificial intelligence, reflecting a coordinated effort between the two institutions to influence and shape AI regulations within the European Union.</data>
