    <edge source="Market Surveillance Authorities" target="AI Office">
      <data key="d6">43.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Market surveillance authorities collaborate with the AI Office to ensure compliance for high-risk AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;The AI Office collaborates with Market Surveillance Authorities to support joint investigations related to high-risk AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;The AI Office coordinates with Market Surveillance Authorities to ensure compliance and monitoring of AI systems under Regulation (EU) 2019/1020.&lt;SEP&gt;The AI Office collaborates with market surveillance authorities to enforce compliance with AI regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;The AI Office oversees and collaborates with market surveillance authorities to ensure compliance of high-risk AI systems with regulations.</data>
