    <edge source="AI Office" target="The Commission">
      <data key="d6">23.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Commission and AI Office both play roles in overseeing compliance and information requests related to AI models.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission collaborates with the AI Office to update guidelines on AI Regulation when necessary.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission evaluates the AI Office's functioning and resources in relation to its regulatory tasks.</data>
