      <data key="d6">24.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The AI Office supports the European Commission by providing methodologies for evaluating AI risks and compliance with regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;The European Commission oversees the AI Office's functions and mandates regarding compliance and assessment of AI related practices.&lt;SEP&gt;The European Commission may liaise with the AI Office to ensure that AI systems are regulated properly within the Union.</data>
