    <edge source="AI Office" target="Board">
      <data key="d6">58.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The AI Office and the Board collaborate closely to establish, monitor, and evaluate codes of practice related to AI regulations. They work together to ensure accountability among participants and assess the effectiveness of these codes. The AI Office provides essential secretariat support to the Board, facilitating its operations and meetings. Additionally, the AI Office acts on requests from the Board, highlighting its role in ensuring regulatory compliance. The Board, in turn, supports the AI Office in monitoring and evaluating the implementation of these codes and consults with the AI Office to guide the evaluations and assessments of AI models. This partnership is crucial for maintaining effective governance in AI practices.&lt;SEP&gt;The AI Office collaborates with the Board to provide support and facilitate interaction among national competent authorities regarding AI sandboxes.</data>
      <data key="d8">administrative support,collaboration,compliance,consultation,coordination,governance,organizational function,oversight,regulatory oversight,regulatory process</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-83ca16d466deaa751e3b9dc390e91e2f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-184360d53ae652d7f48a919e168f375a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f6de18717bcb0167956be85a15dd210f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e3d60cf6cbe0ae91a9793cb5c98a4a92&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-23ab4f338bfa06297d4c996d7d54dc70&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4dc0271c68856282748506ff58069b0</data>
