      <data key="d6">15.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The AI Office supports national competent authorities by providing guidance and resources for the establishment of the AI Regulatory Sandboxes.&lt;SEP&gt;The AI Office works in conjunction with national competent authorities to enforce regulations related to AI technologies.</data>
