    <edge source="AI Office" target="scientific panel">
      <data key="d6">54.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The AI Office and the scientific panel have a collaborative and interdependent relationship focused on the assessment and regulation of artificial intelligence (AI) risks. The AI Office acts on alerts provided by the scientific panel, which indicates that the panel plays a crucial role in alerting the Office to potential risks associated with AI models. This collaborative effort emphasizes the importance of expert advice from the scientific panel, which the AI Office relies upon for guidance related to AI model regulations. 

Additionally, the AI Office supports the scientific panel in fulfilling its responsibilities pertaining to AI evaluation and classification. In return, the scientific panel offers support and advice to the AI Office regarding the implementation and enforcement of AI regulations. Furthermore, the panel enhances the monitoring activities of the AI Office while providing ongoing alerts concerning risks posed by AI models. Together, they work towards effective risk management in the field of artificial intelligence, ensuring a structured approach to AI evaluation and regulation.&lt;SEP&gt;The AI Office relies on the scientific panel to provide alerts and evaluations related to general-purpose AI models.</data>
      <data key="d8">alert system,assessment dependency,collaboration,collaborative effort,expert advisory,expert evaluation,governance,organizational support,regulatory collaboration,regulatory support,risk management,safety alerts</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-1c408a5b914a49af8b42e7e84ad02be6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-140dff8b8263721e25ea86a4104c273d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f3c3fe390cb5d40b199e1bcc024928f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a0c1908573a7d6a832a6b35befbd7ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ec7c9ce58b650afe456517c2483e56c</data>
      <data key="d10">./cached_docs/recital_113.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_68.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_163.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_90.json</data>
      <data key="d11">1747464141</data>
    </edge>
